"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41334261?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TeddyAndrieux","id":41334261,"login":"TeddyAndrieux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzM0MjYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/f2da3c9ea7fae4af31965a5866f5b36db670fffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:09:00Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:38:09Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"message":"test(bdd): upgrade to the installed version\n\nNothing exercised an upgrade where every node already completed the\ndestination, which is how the pre-upgrade drain bug went unnoticed.\nSuch an upgrade skips every node, so it is cheap enough to run in\nevery CI job.\n\nThe scenario first checks that every node recorded the installed\nversion, so it really covers the path where nothing gets deployed.\nIt then checks that no node is left unschedulable.\n\nIssue: MK8S-429","tree":{"sha":"99e0287bd114d98f3aabefc3c421156138ebb2dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/99e0287bd114d98f3aabefc3c421156138ebb2dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/f2da3c9ea7fae4af31965a5866f5b36db670fffa","verification":{"payload":"tree 99e0287bd114d98f3aabefc3c421156138ebb2dc\nparent 4a7d3be3ebb6b0529ce28f08cf9181d2e667860c\nauthor Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790341740 +0000\ncommitter Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790343489 +0000\n\ntest(bdd): upgrade to the installed version\n\nNothing exercised an upgrade where every node already completed the\ndestination, which is how the pre-upgrade drain bug went unnoticed.\nSuch an upgrade skips every node, so it is cheap enough to run in\nevery CI job.\n\nThe scenario first checks that every node recorded the installed\nversion, so it really covers the path where nothing gets deployed.\nIt then checks that no node is left unschedulable.\n\nIssue: MK8S-429\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCgAdFiEE4pABFFF5C1thNKBeeCwKl651RWsFAmq2eUEACgkQeCwKl651\nRWv44Qv9H91/iDdntTfo7Ww+accT1goCVL+/Bm6Rkho09PeQjNk0UqqWqdx4SR35\n7rgMHR5wDrFbhlcoQwgiHZdB7F2RNWVooqIus7ar8UHAHBboqNckPyiSgd7+H3qG\nmkthiv84S+gpfFRvRIdDWv55D4EWv3oVjKAVOfG4RGoljx+yZr0xG/hunh9/217S\na4/H3GsaDS9n5iX/wCkdTLUbPbyCszoyNgjtV54U/laDFGfRkdam6PDkMzF08w/+\n+1qJ2m8NM/J4O6odcP79fdRy/merjUxUxo/tZOTHi/F1i6LoXBCtxS25BWHYaKct\nJm8mLD0Pf/BnRGLzy2FGjISOJv/jN6wB6XcL4sP++GXuxoHrp+hHZsEzw+tYkiML\nZ58pxAF+Vd92pI5DH1cOLfFgAXzMRl4UisI1fxGuvsrzOxWOagP7mJdWzEzC1EIW\nUfNniVbaZxwEp0k0surtWqb8M0BVVT1//IRaZrgYQD0lFy5SFqipUjTa3NagJqF7\nUpMDVr9x\n=do7Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T13:38:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41334261?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur