/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/4a7d3be3ebb6b0529ce28f08cf9181d2e667860c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:09:00Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:38:09Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"message":"fix(salt): record the version the bootstrap node completed\n\n`deploy_node` records the `version-applied` annotation, but bootstrap\ndoes not go through it. A freshly installed bootstrap node only has its\nversion label, which the upgrade does not trust. The first upgrade then\ndeploys this node again, even when it already runs the destination.\n\nRecord the annotation once the bootstrap orchestrate is done.\n\nIssue: MK8S-429","tree":{"sha":"1b555525455bf1b395fba0d8fef15bc4f053cbf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/1b555525455bf1b395fba0d8fef15bc4f053cbf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/4a7d3be3ebb6b0529ce28f08cf9181d2e667860c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b555525455bf1b395fba0d8fef15bc4f053cbf1\nparent f6f1dcbc58c25f1c23bbc530ed35840da8a12f56\nauthor Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790341740 +0000\ncommitter Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790343489 +0000\n\nfix(salt): record the version the bootstrap node completed\n\n`deploy_node` records the `version-applied` annotation, but bootstrap\ndoes not go through it. A freshly installed bootstrap node only has its\nversion label, which the upgrade does not trust. The first upgrade then\ndeploys this node again, even when it already runs the destination.\n\nRecord the annotation once the bootstrap orchestrate is done.\n\nIssue: MK8S-429\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----