,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzM0MjYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/dd6da6b1c41a85212211a6c43d9bf0e2d7b1b576/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:35:41Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:35:41Z","email":"teddy.andrieux@scality.com","name":"Teddy Andrieux"},"message":"fix(salt): drop the NPD ReadonlyFilesystem node condition\n\nThe readonly-monitor raises the ReadonlyFilesystem condition on various\nplatforms without a known root cause. The condition never clears on its\nown: the node-problem-detector pod has to be restarted to reset it. It\nhas no observed impact on the platform either.\n\nStop loading readonly-monitor.json until the root cause is understood.\nIt can be reintroduced later.","tree":{"sha":"c7e1550d675f289df0ddb9adbae378502b450a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/c7e1550d675f289df0ddb9adbae378502b450a00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/dd6da6b1c41a85212211a6c43d9bf0e2d7b1b576","verification":{"payload":"tree c7e1550d675f289df0ddb9adbae378502b450a00\nparent 10acf6fce8c205e2b1119854b2d4b7053febf19e\nauthor Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790328941 +0000\ncommitter Teddy Andrieux <teddy.andrieux@scality.com> 1790328941 +0000\n\nfix(salt): drop the NPD ReadonlyFilesystem node condition\n\nThe readonly-monitor raises the ReadonlyFilesystem condition on various\nplatforms without a known root cause. The condition never clears on its\nown: the node-problem-detector pod has to be restarted to reset it. It\nhas no observed impact on the platform either.\n\nStop loading readonly-monitor.json until the root cause is understood.\nIt can be reintroduced later.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCgAdFiEE4pABFFF5C1thNKBeeCwKl651RWsFAmq2QG0ACgkQeCwKl651\nRWveyAv/TaHqswUVp0bsRT60YxFt9yp3zjJuDQSnW0IhHzo4FYUcnjG/kr6o5Be1\n+lpR8GcBxRMIXjtC0i4w86vauFMHzItH6ORGWkf6ZNWYgtCy9AlZ9vjhpxBvQQ3h\nO1hM8lPs+TBO9rpoClvBwmronjqHKKqiliK9nBO71fYyeDli9ktgjZz9Mb2rMA8K\njc8Hq2grltvULFHMw6AuPGf9W6Jj/rZsT17DlwAvl7W13BPmiTLdfQhTYlpLVcew\nSo8InhocSTqw04/igEh3KtVr7MAFaSFJLC7I56uSm9n/oz41Rp/0YPvuyr9hLUvM\nMp3KMX/xhhcnx3zX2nulK9so14xdZ/QK1FQDNhYTxvnjwKd9r1eN5p/+kdL+06MP\n1d9orxf3ykvfZ97KoAQnsW1q75XdQ49i2FGq/e68nxJnAZwBdaqEWona9Lx/2rFP\nEc0GT26LnHQzevyp9+3PtRwC3mbYD1Oxz8aq2noxiiW0KvwyTNQqtFXg3xRZtMxS\n/elZvZKa\n=i1zQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:39:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41334261?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TeddyAndrieux","id":41334261,"login":"TeddyAndrieux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzM0MjYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeddyAndrieux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith