{"date":"2026-09-15T15:47:49Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:24:09Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(volumes): take the tab''s padding and keep the scrollbar off the title\n\nThe tab supplies a uniform inset that the panel cannot afford, so the overview\nrenders withoutPadding and sets its own, dropping it on the right.\n\nThe title also scrolled with the card and the scrollbar ran the full height of\nthe tab. Only the card scrolls now, so the title holds the top and the scrollbar\nruns beside the content it belongs to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ea61bce74f56b1b7db5ddea58914ac58c078f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/3ea61bce74f56b1b7db5ddea58914ac58c078f6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/7c926d7d2e9e8e9791168bfc3ebd47cdb0310cf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScal