mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:34:51Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:24:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(forms): give the label columns a width that follows the root size\n\nforceLabelWidth takes a number as pixels, so the label column kept a width\nmeasured once against a 16px root the shell does not use. A string is an\nabsolute length and tracks the root font size instead, which also drops a\ntable utility imported into a form to do the conversion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf5c5d96b56cdd05f441b3072f977abfa3060b12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/cf5c5d96b56cdd05f441b3072f977abfa3060b12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/ffa6748476f043c21ac50246c5460520e30359d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/ffa6748476f043c21ac50246c5460520e30359d4","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGZmYTY3NDg0NzZmMDQzYzIxYWM1MDI0NmM1NDYwNTIwZTMwMzU5ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78","sha":"eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78"}],"sha":"ffa6748476f043c21ac50246c5460520e30359d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/ffa6748476f043c21ac50246c5460520e30359d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:26:19Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:24:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(volumes): keep the volume overview inside the panel\n\nThe title row could not wrap, and the delete button is sized to its own content,\nso a long volume name pushed the button past the panel''s edge. The label pairs\nhad the same effect from the other side: a key like kubernetes.io/hostname has\nno break opportunity, and break-word does not lower an element''s intrinsic\nminimum width, so the row held the card open at its full width.\n\nThe title row now wraps with the button keeping the right edge, the two card\ncolumns may shrink, and label pairs break anywhere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1f72b7d32bb9a8ae8812d80c191aa2e016a5b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/d1f72b7d32bb9a8ae8812d80c191aa2e016a5b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGViOWNiMjA5N2ExNTAwMzc4Y2FkZTA1ZDI0NWMyODc2YTYxOTlkNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c","sha":"75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c"}],"sha":"eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/eb9cb2097a1500378cade05d245c2876a6199d78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:50:50Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:24:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(ui): keep the scrollbar styling through a navigation\n\nThe bare ''@scality/core-ui'' specifier is federation-shared and resolves to the\nhost''s copy, so the root ScrollbarWrapper mount lived in a different copy of the\nlibrary than the Select and Form that mount the same global style transiently.\nstyled-components keys a global style group by a hash of its CSS and rebuilds it\nfrom the mounting copy''s own instances, so unmounting a Select emptied the group\nand left every scrollbar unstyled until a reload.\n\nImporting through the subpath puts the permanent mount in the same copy as the\ntransient ones, so the group is rebuilt from it instead of being emptied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eaf9dd98e36b1a81a6e13a32fa5cb7ff8cdbba0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/eaf9dd98e36b1a81a6e13a32fa5cb7ff8cdbba0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDc1ZjU5YTM0NDY2MWVjNzlhNmIxMDgyNzBmODAzMjM2MTg5M2ZkOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/1160b4f1cc6d4a9c496e8bd8d4d1a6bb96c1719e","sha":"1160b4f1cc6d4a9c496e8bd8d4d1a6bb96c1719e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/1160b4f1cc6d4a9c496e8bd8d4d1a6bb96c1719e"}],"sha":"75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/75f59a344661ec79a6b108270f8032361893fd8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/1160b4f1cc6d4a9c496e8bd8d4d1a6bb96c1719e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:09:49Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:24:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(tables): show N/A when a volume''s usage is unknown\n\nA volume with no used/capacity sample in Prometheus has an undefined usage, and\nthe progress bar''s percentage prop defaults to 50 when it is not a number: the\ncell rendered a half-full bar labelled ''undefined%'', so an unknown usage read as\na real measurement.\n\nThe three usage cells now share one component, which renders an empty bar\nlabelled N/A when the value is not a finite number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ea8688538e155fc3e6bc2532152c2cee13dbf98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/3ea8688538e155fc3e6bc2532152c2cee13dbf98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/1160b4f1cc6d4a9c496e8bd8d4d1a6bb96c1719e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScali