,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bert-e","id":25904340,"login":"bert-e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTA0MzQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bert-e","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/39f2ae1b09ffcb3abd2213cfa3c96e2bf5388b15","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDM5ZjJhZTFiMDlmZmNiM2FiZDIyMTNjZmEzYzk2ZTJiZjUzODhiMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/b74962ce99f878d415c012f9ba911a793f2651be","sha":"b74962ce99f878d415c012f9ba911a793f2651be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/b74962ce99f878d415c012f9ba911a793f2651be"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/71d3b06e6e809cde52339fd377a96e92b29601dd","sha":"71d3b06e6e809cde52339fd377a96e92b29601dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/71d3b06e6e809cde52339fd377a96e92b29601dd"}],"sha":"39f2ae1b09ffcb3abd2213cfa3c96e2bf5388b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/39f2ae1b09ffcb3abd2213cfa3c96e2bf5388b15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/56293a12514667983a13239e61465d47d5d17659/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T10:23:48Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(dashboard): give the dashboard a single scroll owner\n\nRestacking made three boxes scrollable at once: the wrapper, the grid, and the\ninventory and network cards inside it. One list could sit behind three nested\nscrollbars.\n\nThe wrapper is now the only scroll container. Each restack step releases the\ngrid from the wrapper''s height - stretched to it with overflow: hidden the\nextra rows would be clipped rather than scrolled - and the cards stop being\nscroll containers on both axes, since overflow-y: visible computes back to auto\nwhenever the other axis is not visible.","tree":{"sha":"3c67db9c6061ebe322f477e4078484c9a49525f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/3c67db9c6061ebe322f477e4078484c9a49525f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/56293a12514667983a13239e61465d47d5d17659","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/56293a12514667983a13239e61465d47d5d17659","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDU2MjkzYTEyNTE0NjY3OTgzYTEzMjM5ZTYxNDY1ZDQ3ZDVkMTc2NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c","sha":"bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c"}],"sha":"56293a12514667983a13239e61465d47d5d17659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/56293a12514667983a13239e61465d47d5d17659"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T10:00:02Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(dashboard): keep the inventory a sidebar and let the metrics header wrap\n\nThe dashboard''s first restack step put the metrics on their own full-width row,\nwhich reads oddly: the inventory is a sidebar next to two chart groups, not a\npeer of them. It now keeps a full-height left column with the metrics moving\nunder the network, and only the second step stacks all three. The inventory\ncards are capped so they stay card-shaped rather than stretching with the\ncolumn.\n\nThe metrics tab header held a toggle, a Grafana link and the timespan selector\non one row, which does not fit a ~370px panel. The header wraps, the toggle\ntakes its own line once narrow, the Grafana link collapses to its icon, and the\nchart area''s height subtraction follows the taller header - otherwise the\ncharts overflow by exactly the second line.","tree":{"sha":"13342076774043230fe375263446dad01649493c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/13342076774043230fe375263446dad01649493c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGJiYzk5NDBiZTYyY2IxOTAyNTU4OGVhNjQzNTBiN2MxMmI3Y2JjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450","sha":"7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450"}],"sha":"bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/bbc9940be62cb19025588ea64350b7c12b7cbc3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T10:00:02Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(overview): stack the overview rows at one width instead of per row\n\nEach key/value row carried its own flex-wrap, so a row broke onto two lines as\nsoon as its own value stopped fitting. Neighbouring rows therefore broke at\ndifferent panel widths, which reads as a rendering fault rather than a layout.\n\nOne container query now switches every row together, and the label drops its\nalignment floor once stacked, where it would only add dead space.\n\nVolume labels get one pair per line: they are unrelated to each other, so\nsharing a line makes one label''s name read as the previous one''s value.","tree":{"sha":"a2fb87f3e9829133d25736f559a5b86fa69cbb02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/a2fb87f3e9829133d25736f559a5b86fa69cbb02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDdjMGU4ZGRhYTExNzc3MGEzYmU1Mjg1ZmQzNTUyZDBiMTA2NjI0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14","sha":"fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14"}],"sha":"7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/7c0e8ddaa117770a3be5285fd3552d0b10662450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T09:59:49Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(tables): size table headers for the sort caret and reveal dropped columns\n\nA sortable header reserves 1.25rem for the sort caret, and a centred one\nreserves it on both sides. The previous minimum widths were derived from the\ncell contents only, so on the narrow columns the reservation consumed the whole\ncolumn and the header label ellipsized away to nothing while the cell below\nstill rendered - most visibly Severity, a 2.5rem column paying a 2.5rem\nreservation.\n\nEvery minimum now covers the label plus the reservation its alignment implies.\n\nDropped columns are revealed on the two list tables as well, so no column\nleaves without its values staying reachable, and the volume tables drop earlier\n- side by side they were crowded well before the first threshold.","tree":{"sha":"9a50d8ad41b882896f33dbfa755f55c049a1dbe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/9a50d8ad41b882896f33dbfa755f55c049a1dbe8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGZmZmIwODM2N2Y4OTg1NDkyOWI3NzZkMDkxYWQ1NGI5OTRlNzhkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f","sha":"64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f"}],"sha":"fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/fffb08367f89854929b776d091ad54b994e78d14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:37:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(dashboard): restack the dashboard and the metrics graphs with container queries\n\nThe dashboard is a single row of five equal columns, so once the Guardian drawer\nnarrows the content box the inventory gets ~150px and each chart group ~300px --\nand the grid is overflow: hidden, so the result is silently clipped rather than\nscrollable. It now restacks in two steps: three columns over two rows below\n1100px, fully stacked below 700px, switching to overflow-y: auto as soon as it is\nmore than one row.\n\nThose rows carry an explicit minmax() minimum rather than auto. .network and\n.metrics are min-height: 0 flex columns holding self-sizing charts, which on a\nplain auto row collapse to nothing.\n\nThe dashboard is not inside a TwoPanelLayout, so nothing above it declared a\nquery container -- DashboardContainer does. Its width: 100% is load-bearing:\ncontainer-type: inline-size implies contain: inline-size, so a content-sized box\nwould resolve to 0px wide and take the grid with it.\n\nGraphGrid drops from two columns to one below 560px, which sits between the\nright panel''s drawer-open (~370px) and drawer-closed (~620px) widths. It\nresolves against the panel container added earlier in this branch, and is shared\nby the node and volume metrics tabs. Its tracks become minmax(0, 1fr): a bare fr\nfloors at the content''s min-content width, which self-sizing charts push past.\n\nNo jsdom container-query shim is needed here, unlike identity-ui. jsdom 20.0.3\ndoes drop a whole stylesheet on @container, but measured on this suite the parse\nerror count is 0 both before and after this commit and all 24 suites stay green\n-- styled-components reaches the CSSOM through insertRule rather than the text\nstyle block that triggers jsdom''s parser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddf27b91e636dd5f4f5627de2b63e578a2f0c2b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/ddf27b91e636dd5f4f5627de2b63e578a2f0c2b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDY0ZGRhZjZkMGQ0ZWJiMmNiMDZhMDkyZTViYmExNGRmMzhlZTYwOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8","sha":"f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8"}],"sha":"64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/64ddaf6d0d4ebb2cb06a092e5bba14df38ee608f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:31:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(ui): unpin the alerts header and let the overview rows wrap\n\nTwo surfaces that overflowed by arithmetic alone.\n\nThe alerts page header held three summary segments pinned at width: 250px each\n-- 750px before the \"Email notification configuration\" button, inside a 768px\ncontent box. The segments now divide the available width equally and the header\nwraps, so the button drops to its own line instead of the page scrolling\nsideways.\n\nTheir divider went with the pinning: SeperationLine was a 250px absolutely\npositioned box whose right border landed at the segment''s edge only because the\nsegment was exactly that wide. Each segment now draws its own via ::after, which\nfollows a fluid width and keeps the 37px height the old one had.\n\nThe node and volume overview rows put a 10.714rem floor on the label to keep the\nrows aligned, which in the ~370px right panel left almost nothing for the value.\nThe row wraps now, so a long value takes its own line at full width instead of\nbeing squeezed to a few characters.\n\nAlso here, the two list toolbars collapse their primary action to its icon below\na 480px panel -- between the ~370px the panel measures with the drawer open and\nthe ~620px it measures without, so the label survives the drawer-closed case.\nThese resolve against the panel container added earlier in this branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e05901ed7396d1ad18cfe263b0ea7d15a2a55bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/e05901ed7396d1ad18cfe263b0ea7d15a2a55bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGYyYWFkZmEwOWIzNTU5ZWI0MTk2MzcwYjk0ZDUwZTNiYzE1ODhlZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2","sha":"913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2"}],"sha":"f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/f2aadfa09b3559eb4196370b94d50e3bc1588ee8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:28:46Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(tables): give every table a minimum column width and a drop order\n\nTwo halves of one decision, so they land together: eleven flex columns across\nsix tables had no minWidth, and no table dropped anything. A minWidth on its own\njust converts clipping into overflow, and a dropAt on its own leaves the\nsurviving columns free to starve each other -- the pair is what makes a table\nnarrow cleanly.\n\nDrop order is least-diagnostic-first, so the health/name pair always survives:\n  NodeListTable      Status 360, Roles 440\n  VolumeListTable    Node 340, Status 380, Usage 420, Size 480, Latency 560\n  NodePageVolumes    Status 380, Usage 420, Size 480, Latency 560\n  NodePartitionTable Size 340, Usage 400\n  NodePagePodsTab    Status 340, Age 420, Namespace 460\n  AlertsTab          Active since 440\n  AlertPage          Active since 620\n\nrevealDroppedColumns is enabled on the five read-only tables ONLY. The two list\ntables (nodes, volumes) pass onRowSelected, and in core-ui 0.227.0 the row''s\nonClick fires for any click inside the row -- useDroppedColumns never stops\npropagation and the row handler does not check the event target -- so the +N\nchip would navigate instead of opening its popover on every row. Their dropped\ncolumns are all visible in the detail panel the row click opens, so dropping\nwithout the chip loses nothing. Enable it there once core-ui ships the\nrow-click target guard.\n\nThresholds are CONTAINER widths, not viewport widths, and were derived from the\npanel geometry rather than measured -- they need probe confirmation against a\nrunning shell before this merges.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9b38cf62bebce60d9021fdb2a8340d6b440d025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/c9b38cf62bebce60d9021fdb2a8340d6b440d025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDkxM2Y5NTQ2OWZmMTZiNjc2NmY5NzJkYWQzN2UyNDA3NGJiZjUzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e","sha":"95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e"}],"sha":"913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/913f95469ff16b6766f972dad37e24074bbf53e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:24:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:36Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(panels): declare query containers on the node and volume panel layouts\n\nNeither TwoPanelLayout opted into a container, so every @container query nested\nin either panel -- core-ui''s own, and the ones added later in this branch -- had\nno ancestor to resolve against and silently never matched. That is the enabler\nfor the rest of the work on these two routes and the eleven tab routes below\nthem: iconOnly and column drops cannot fire without it.\n\ncontainer=\"both\" because both sides have to adapt: the left panel holds the list\ntable and its toolbar, the right holds the tab content.\n\nLeftSideInstanceList gets min-width: 0 for the same reason -- as a flex: 1 item\nit would otherwise refuse to shrink below the table''s content width, so the\npanel could never actually narrow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49ddf1661f6ec2d69a2d635a41a2fc10da25ca81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/49ddf1661f6ec2d69a2d635a41a2fc10da25ca81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDk1YWY2NWFkNzRjNmI4N2ZmY2JkMDM5ZTgzOGQ4NjEwNWRjN2U1NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/63d86c6b7f43f237167c3d1234556bed35b34055","sha":"63d86c6b7f43f237167c3d1234556bed35b34055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/63d86c6b7f43f237167c3d1234556bed35b34055"}],"sha":"95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/95af65ad74c6b87ffcbd039e838d86105dc7e55e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/63d86c6b7f43f237167c3d1234556bed35b34055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:24:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:56:35Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(shell-ui): anchor the notification center to the content column, not the viewport\n\nThe navbar renders inside the flex-1 content column that the Guardian drawer\nnarrows; the drawer is its sibling and takes 500px without changing\nwindow.innerWidth. The menu clamped its offset against window.innerWidth, so it\nwas free to extend the full drawer width underneath the drawer.\n\nAnchor it to the bell''s right edge instead. The menu is already inside a\nposition: relative wrapper, so right: 0 keeps it within the column at any width\nwith no measurement at all -- which also fixes a second failure: the bounding\nrect it positioned from was captured once on mount and never updated, and the\ndrawer resizes the column live without a reload.\n\nAlso in this component, both consequences of the removed 25vw:\n- the row''s text column hand-computed calc(25vw - 5.75rem) as its share of the\n  menu width; it is a flex: 1 child, so min-width: 0 is what it actually needed\n  to ellipsize rather than push the unread mark out of the row.\n- justifyConent was misspelt, so that row never got its space-between.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1707e68fe6b3ac8762c35af5275b9b2c8f015068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/1707e68fe6b3ac8762c35af5275b9b2c8f015068"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/63d86c6b7f43f237167c3d1234556bed35b34055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality