rl":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/8db442ecbcdd6113dae73c0ff3ed0e884591cafc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:57:10Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:16:30Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"message":"refactor(salt): rely on the containerd include instead of repeating it\n\nmetalk8s.container-engine.containerd.installed already includes metalk8s.repo\nand its own running state, so listing the three of them added nothing to the\ncompiled highstate. The formula test now expects the single include.\n\nThe bootstrap role does not need the image cache either: the bootstrap node is\nalways labelled master, and the master role includes the node role, which\nbrings the formula in.","tree":{"sha":"0dbd0c6f7a421159b217a1be7662d538a74cf683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/0dbd0c6f7a421159b217a1be7662d538a74cf683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/8db442ecbcdd6113dae73c0ff3ed0e884591cafc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dbd0c6f7a421159b217a1be7662d538a74cf683\nparent 72933cfccc54d7e514718a62c62fb69f5100aa6f\nauthor Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788789430 +0200\ncommitter Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788790590 +0200\n\nrefactor(salt): rely on the containerd include instead of repeating it\n\nmetalk8s.container-engine.containerd.installed already includes metalk8s.repo\nand its own running state, so listing the three of them added nothing to the\ncompiled highstate. The formula test now expects the single include.\n\nThe bootstrap role does not need the image cache either: 