ubernetes objects, so nothing caught a\nnode where a MetalK8s package failed to install or a unit failed to start.\nTwo scenarios now ask salt, from the salt-master pod, for the state of a\npackage and of a systemd unit on every minion.\n\ncontainerd-image-preload and its timer are the first entries.","tree":{"sha":"acaa177c7a915ce22c0fac4e5b8a8cad27d7980e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/acaa177c7a915ce22c0fac4e5b8a8cad27d7980e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/e77ed37ad10016834a0ef6ae5acfb0d37c404d98","verification":{"payload":"tree acaa177c7a915ce22c0fac4e5b8a8cad27d7980e\nparent bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0\nauthor Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788268146 +0200\ncommitter Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788521313 +0200\n\ntest(post): check the image preload package and timer on every node\n\nThe sanity checks only looked at Kubernetes objects, so nothing caught a\nnode where a MetalK8s package failed to install or a unit failed to start.\nTwo scenarios now ask salt, from the salt-master pod, for the state of a\npackage and of a systemd unit on every minion.\n\ncontainerd-image-preload and its timer are the first entries.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQBeSVJcD2ZrbqXtLF0uKJwZUOQDwUCapqrYQAKCRB0uKJwZUOQ\nD0Z7APwJ0/MyNs790KYN2nMpzguqQnZ4un+gWgz5dIK13jR0PgEA6F/9xkuEPvn9\nKgiXkqIeS9Dis/hRWoWa1LH/bg4p1gQ=\n=nyQq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T11:30:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/