starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:08:56Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T11:28:33Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"message":"test(salt): cover the image preload timer requisites\n\nRendering a formula only proves its Jinja is valid. This test reads the\nrequisites back: the timer must depend on its own package, on the containerd\npackage, on the containerd readiness check and on the repository gate, and\nthe branch for a node without a container engine must include nothing at\nall.\n\ntest_container_engine.py already walked require chains with a private\nhelper, so it moves to fixtures/rendered.py and both tests use it. The\nformulas config gets the two rendering cases the new test needs.","tree":{"sha":"d795b6c953735b1e5da1f0371c8d8c5eb70d5ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/d795b6c953735b1e5da1f0371c8d8c5eb70d5ac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0","verification":{"payload":"tree d795b6c953735b1e5da1f0371c8d8c5eb70d5ac3\nparent 8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05\nauthor Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788268136 +0200\ncommitter Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788521313 +0200\n\ntest(salt): cover the image preload timer requisites\n\nRendering a formula only proves its Jinja is valid. This test reads the\nrequisites back: the timer must depend on its own package, on the containerd\npackage, on the containerd readiness check and on the repository gate, and\nthe branch for a node without a container engine must include nothing at\nall.\n\ntest_container_engine.py already walked require chains with a private\nhelper, so it moves to fixtures/rendered.py and both tests use it. The\nformulas config gets the two rendering cases the new test needs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQBeSVJcD2ZrbqXtLF0uKJwZUOQDwUCapqrYQAKCRB0uKJwZUOQ\nD20EAQDsS4v9S22w6p7JIL1pd4swvVctVYLqEXcsG/pooWvN7AD6A1Yv4uVJybNk\n9A11W2U1tgSaSgk0YKrB+H3lCCAJJAI=\n=3/7H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T11:30:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ezekiel-alexrod","id":131964409,"login":"ezekiel-alexrod","node_id":"U_kgDOB92d-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKGJmMDdhMzUwYmJkNmYzYzU3Y2M4Y2UwZGZjZjUwM2ViM2Q5OWFlZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05","sha":"8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05"}],"sha":"bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/bf07a350bbd6f3c57cc8ce0dfcf503eb3d99aed0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ezekiel-alexrod","id":131964409,"login":"ezekiel-alexrod","node_id":"U_kgDOB92d-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:08:46Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T11:28:33Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"message":"feat(salt): install and enable the containerd image preload timer\n\nThe containerd-image-preload package ships its systemd units disabled, on\npurpose: the spec leaves enabling them to the provisioning layer. So we\ninstall the package and start containerd-image-preload.timer ourselves,\nfrom a new metalk8s.image-cache formula that the node and bootstrap roles\nboth include.\n\nThe timer fires as soon as it starts (OnBootSec=0), then every 10 minutes,\nand the script it runs imports into a live containerd. The states therefore\nrequire the containerd package and the readiness check on the running\nengine. A node with no container engine renders a no-op instead of pulling\ncontainerd in.\n\nThe package requires containerd, a name the containerd.io 2.2.2 RPM we ship\nprovides, so the dependency resolves on a fresh node.\n\nNew salt files also go in buildchain/buildchain/salt_tree.py, otherwise\nthey never reach the ISO.","tree":{"sha":"f7912b94bc736dd87ddb37e2a7a0365a036817b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/f7912b94bc736dd87ddb37e2a7a0365a036817b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05","verification":{"payload":"tree f7912b94bc736dd87ddb37e2a7a0365a036817b4\nparent e4ac27dbbd3305b0c3a797b09006726ac2c1c5c2\nauthor Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788268126 +0200\ncommitter Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788521313 +0200\n\nfeat(salt): install and enable the containerd image preload timer\n\nThe containerd-image-preload package ships its systemd units disabled, on\npurpose: the spec leaves enabling them to the provisioning layer. So we\ninstall the package and start containerd-image-preload.timer ourselves,\nfrom a new metalk8s.image-cache formula that the node and bootstrap roles\nboth include.\n\nThe timer fires as soon as it starts (OnBootSec=0), then every 10 minutes,\nand the script it runs imports into a live containerd. The states therefore\nrequire the containerd package and the readiness check on the running\nengine. A node with no container engine renders a no-op instead of pulling\ncontainerd in.\n\nThe package requires containerd, a name the containerd.io 2.2.2 RPM we ship\nprovides, so the dependency resolves on a fresh node.\n\nNew salt files also go in buildchain/buildchain/salt_tree.py, otherwise\nthey never reach the ISO.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQBeSVJcD2ZrbqXtLF0uKJwZUOQDwUCapqrYQAKCRB0uKJwZUOQ\nDxWSAP4zHa9nOHtI4kbgunC7B3d8/7Jdb3/79HtLdG/fVoxflAEAwnRmYZEn/PKa\nbTymmJz4T5YcnLeWgkCCKSz0anT5zAY=\n=gQ5M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T11:30:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ezekiel-alexrod","id":131964409,"login":"ezekiel-alexrod","node_id":"U_kgDOB92d-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/8bf31fe8bbcd3088b00ce803d5bf907f894c0e05","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDhiZjMxZmU4YmJjZDMwODhiMDBjZTgwM2Q1YmY5MDdmODk0YzBlMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/e4ac27dbbd3305b0c3a797b09006726ac2c1c5c2","sha":"e4ac27dbbd3305b0c3a797b09006726ac2c1c5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/e4ac27dbbd3305b0c3a79