tent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ezekiel-alexrod","id":131964409,"login":"ezekiel-alexrod","node_id":"U_kgDOB92d-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/7eaffd4c401880d982a5b8f81e63e9aa7f4d968c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T14:32:50Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:16:20Z","email":"131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Rodriguez"},"message":"refactor(buildchain): declare a prebuilt package once\n\n`containerd-image-preload` was declared twice. The release, the digest and\nthe RPM release digit sat in their own constants, and the version pin every\nnode installs was written by hand next to them, once per RedHat release. A\nbump had to move both, and nothing caught it if only one moved.\n\n`versions.PrebuiltRPM` holds the whole declaration, and both sides read it:\n`_prebuilt_rpm_package` takes the release and the digest from it, and the\n`PackageVersion` entries of `PACKAGES` are generated from its tag, so the\nversion the build fetches and the version the Salt states pin cannot\ndiverge. The rendered package list is unchanged.\n\nThe repository the package lands in comes from the declaration too, which\nis what `RPM_TO_FETCH` groups by, so the name is written once instead of\nbeing passed around.","tree":{"sha":"5217681d3580dbe2118609f4c69f4aa326b08d09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/trees/5217681d3580dbe2118609f4c69f4aa326b08d09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/git/commits/7eaffd4c401880d982a5b8f81e63e9aa7f4d968c","verification":{"payload":"tree 5217681d3580dbe2118609f4c69f4aa326b08d09\nparent eaa366566540de1b9b9c60b6def9502e9484e75d\nauthor Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788273170 +0200\ncommitter Alex Rodriguez <131964409+ezekiel-alexrod@users.noreply.github.com> 1788430580 +0200\n\nrefactor(buildchain): declare a prebuilt package once\n\n`containerd-image-preload` was declared twice. The release, the digest and\nthe RPM release digit sat in their own constants, and the version pin every\nnode installs was written by hand next to them, once per RedHat release. A\nbump had to move both, and nothing caught it if only one moved.\n\n`versions.PrebuiltRPM` holds the whole declaration, and both sides read it:\n`_prebuilt_rpm_package` takes the release and the digest from it, and the\n`PackageVersion` entries of `PACKAGES` are generated from its tag, so the\nversion the build fetches and the version the Salt states pin cannot\ndiverge. The rendered package list is unchanged.\n\nThe repository the package lands in comes from the declaration too, which\nis what `RPM_TO_FETCH` groups by, so the name is written once instead of\nbeing passed around.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQBeSVJcD2ZrbqXtLF0uKJwZUOQDwUCaplI9AAKCRB0uKJwZUOQ\nD4MsAQD22wxQOIOnhBxDqRfvRcapCfCHDhfYvL27rudHFoUozgD+Mkt9cAM8l4Pa\nz80pe0HoIiBuiPsBBUPq5OlihGFDgQA=\n=2b7w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T10:17:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131964409?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ezekiel-alexrod","id":131964409,"login":"ezekiel-alexrod","node_id":"U_kgDOB92d-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezekiel-alexrod","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/7eaffd4c401880d982a5b8f81e63e9aa7f4d968c","node_id":"C_kwDOB3HpytoAKDdlYWZmZDRjNDAxODgwZDk4MmE1YjhmODFlNjNlOWFhN2Y0ZDk2OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/metalk8s/commit/eaa366566540de1b9b9c60b6def9502e9484e75d","sha":"eaa366566540de1b9b9c60b6def9502e9484e75d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/eaa366566540de1b9b9c60b6def9502e9484e75d"}],"sha":"7eaffd4c401880d982a5b8f81e63e9aa7f4d968c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits/7eaffd4c401880d982a5b8f81e63e9aa7f4d968c"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/metalk8s/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=2e410becce8797a81fbb2f954951b05e7f9d4a88&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A10.235Z"}');
