05 (#1001)\n\n* fix(Security): Bump internal dependencies\n\nfix(build): Bump to gradle 7.6.6 as that fixes issues with dependency check\n\nbuild(Security): Configured dependency checker\n\nfix(Security): Tweaks to dependencies to try to get ahead of CVEs\n\nfix(Security): Hook up API keys for dependency check analyser\n\nci(Security): Add more dependency suppressions and ensuree XML report\n\nci(Security): Add more dependency suppressions\n\nchore: Include backup version of old dependency-check-suppressions file\n\nbuild: Suppress non-vulnerable deps\n\nbuild: Set scanConfigurations explicitly and remove now-unnecessary groovy logback dependency\n\nfix(Security): Fix internal dependencies\n\nFix ext versions, bouncyCastle, and netty versions, bring versions out into gradle.properties for ease of upgrade\n\nci: Suppress more non vulnerable dependencies\n\nfix(Security): More dependency bumps for security\n\nfix(Security): Set hikari and postgres versions from gradle.properties\n\nfix(Security): Logback-classic and core\n\n* ci: Add sbom action\n\nbuild: Add OSV Scanner and SBOM generator\nci: Test hello world runner\nci: Allow hello-test on all pushes\nci: Tweak to hello test\nci: Tweak to hello test (on every push)\nci: Explicitly pass in secrets\nci: Tweak pipeline name to test rerun\nchore: Remove all in-repo dependency checkers\nci: Tweak to pipeline name to force rerun\n\nchore: remove gradle lockfile and gradle.properties references to other scanners\n\nchore: automated compliance assets update via Syft [skip ci]\n\n* ci: Configure SBOM generation workflows\n\nchore: automated compliance assets update via Syft [skip ci]\n\nre rerun sbom\n\nci: Actually point sbom generation at service directory\n\nchore: Update actions to v5 and add affected entries to vex file\n\nchore: Update application.vex\n\nchore: Remove vex file from git\n\n* fix(Security): Bump micronaut-json-core/netty versions\n\nAlso don''t run SBOM generation twice on PRs\n\n* chore: automated compliance assets update via Syft [skip ci]\n\n* chore: automated compliance assets update via Syft [skip ci]\n\n* ci: Only commit SBOM on pushes to `master` or manual trigger","tree":{"sha":"0d555bbdd329cb3ed14a71c8abe1851f358c9802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/trees/0d555bbdd329cb3ed14a71c8abe1851f358c9802"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/commits/149e88a7368d0b34cf503dfcdbe7569024609d37","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d555bbdd329cb3ed14a71c8abe1851f358c9802\nparent 6a0c81a405e1af09deae564d3ee078739672e961\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1781701864 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781701864 +0100\n\nfix(Security): Security version bumps and SBOM generation -- ERM-4105 (#1001)\n\n* fix(Security): Bump internal dependencies\n\nfix(build): Bump to gradle 7.6.6 as that fixes issues with dependency check\n\nbuild(Security): Configured dependency checker\n\nfix(Security): Tweaks to dependencies to try to get ahead of CVEs\n\nfix(Security): Hook up API keys for dependency check analyser\n\nci(Security): Add more dependency suppressions and ensuree XML report\n\nci(Security): Add more dependency suppressions\n\nchore: Include backup version of old dependency-check-suppressions file\n\nbuild: Suppress non-vulnerable deps\n\nbuild: Set scanConfigurations explicitly and remove now-unnecessary groovy logback dependency\n\nfix(Security): Fix internal dependencies\n\nFix ext versions, bouncyCastle, and netty versions, bring versions out into gradle.properties for ease of upgrade\n\nci: Suppress more non vulnerable dependencies\n\nfix(Security): More dependency bumps for security\n\nfix(Security): Set hikari and postgres versions from gradle.properties\n\nfix(Security): Logback-classic and core\n\n* ci: Add sbom action\n\nbuild: Add OSV Scanner and SBOM generator\nci: Test hello world runner\nci: Allow hello-test on all pushes\nci: Tweak to hello test\nci: Tw