NzQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/commits/80f22a1cd5a2cde97bb01e16a0a581b1aa3111ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-21T14:54:23Z","email":"54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com","name":"EthanFreestone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-21T14:54:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build(permissions): Set up ModuleDescriptor with separate permissions for each action endpoint -- ERM-3717, ERM-3919 (#969)\n\n* build(permissions): Set up ModuleDescriptor with separate permissions for each action endpoint -- ERM-3717, ERM-3919\n\nCurrently all actions are available to a user under the same permission, meaning that there is no way to granularly grant permissions for a specific action and not another\n\nThe current action: `erm.admin.action.execute` has been replaced by a new visible permission: `erm.admin.action.all.execute`.\n\nEach action has been granted its own granular permission, and the all perm houses them as subPermissions\n\nCurrently all of the granular permissions are also `visible: true`, but this can be discussed\n\nrefs ERM-3717, ERM-3919\n\n* build(permissions): Include \"Agreements:\" prefix on other backend visible perms","tree":{"sha":"5e07f5226b06346fb10ef36d30ae124622ae57d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/trees/5e07f5226b06346fb10ef36d30ae124622ae57d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/commits/80f22a1cd5a2cde97bb01e16a0a581b1aa3111ca","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e07f5226b06346fb10ef36d30ae124622ae57d7\nparent 9d97978744ae52af7f227dae584c8cf488c6c0a2\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1769007263 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769007263 +0000\n\nbuild(permissions): Set up ModuleDescriptor with separate permissions for each action endpoint -- ERM-3717, ERM-3919 (#969)\n\n* build(permissions): Set up ModuleDescriptor with separate permissions for each action endpoint -- ERM-3717, ERM-3919\n\nCurrently all actions are available to a user under the same permission, meaning that there is no way to granularly grant permissions for a specific action and not another\n\nThe current action: `erm.admin.action.execute` has been replaced by a new visible permission: `erm.admin.action.all.execute`.\n\nEach action has been granted its own granular permission, and the all perm houses them as subPermissions\n\nCurrently all of the granular permissions are also `visible: true`, but this can be discussed\n\nrefs ERM-3717, ERM-3919\n\n* build(permissions): Include \"Agreements:\" prefix on other backend visible perms","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpcOifCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7NcQAKxR0ltosYjrSlbk5r+cR/un\nHfFfk98d1C+hGfxePnzdCAQSaoLv7bS/Ei4eB7OuEVUwaKxPrTGntYF8jaIfRKgz\not7zK+4gDMKLlKhxH/A//VVdi5rQs9aV3cGbZ4Z5Bze6B+lpuMWyGljkpSOGtiCE\nmBk+XcvFq2LTK7rlVc8tVr5wdrw5LCn+//NChbIMN1cmcayp81RjP7ebcmBMg9IX\nrK6OAmgfccSV62aGWEL/hJgEbq+YrqpVaXt1sVvBDTz5b9yHUHlu9XN8qNTDzVLV\nfi1ZenWyG3SJf3xEi+bqVt7AyQlU5dZ3jeVzJgrG3+do2MBuef7S2w/fWH2CT9yx\nxfU5aGO8uuUMb2kmNSL8f8alZTYsYvNFLP/lCr77LDCJeF7O+OjtqW/VkizxAhvM\nD4ZVBCz2HX/GtPrGyWbe21jEAy8/ezydxQijlrtzsHm9fWLaiU9L5pcg9sNwh/Me\nTwQLTyL9329U/lZMcKrMbYmi2Yg8ZMY56ir0hgEh5vwM2w8cYMMq7wdxVDsxtN0y\n68HgOCwheSA6ge5E52Hgatg5Gc20hnyCUiRUYIAqbyVAncw3cdUM4jJgsfQDGDmR\nxNEbXJeyzDvyTW0i9nQO47hEZJhFN+nadwqeIzph4IvPp8NfiUq+whD8DOA+xqOX\nigGYUKO1iO8spjOAEjId\n=UBhG\n---