p grails-okapi -> 8.0.2 and web-toolkit-ce -> 10.4.0\n\n* fix(sample-data): return _data to how it was before (Changes should be local for testing)\n\n* chore: Revert default running memory with bootRun\n\n* Ensure that the referenced folio-style values have defaults\n\n* build: Fix placement of db block in application yml\n\n* fix: Job runner error\n\n* fix: Revert accidental change to application yml defaults\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Steve Osguthorpe <steve.osguthorpe@k-int.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba51ea360ce00f5b61a03c115cdefb97e18200b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/trees/ba51ea360ce00f5b61a03c115cdefb97e18200b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/commits/d89f8d535bd6f196ee3190fef5883d26fd4e870c","verification":{"payload":"tree ba51ea360ce00f5b61a03c115cdefb97e18200b0\nparent 2474ce09700b581ba62fee8558aafafbf4270c09\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1763377452 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763377452 +0000\n\nfix: Long standing connection issues -- ERM-3851 (#953)\n\n* build: Set up different application descriptor stuff to try and test system connections\n\n* build:  back to 1.5GB for repeatability in tests\n\n* chore: Swap docker compose image to PG 17 and bumped to 5000 connections\n\n* chore: Include folios workflow script in module scripts directory\n\n* fix(dependencies): Bump grails-okapi -> 8.0.2 and web-toolkit-ce -> 10.4.0\n\n* fix(sample-data): return _data to how it was before (Changes should be local for testing)\n\n* chore: Revert default running memory with bootRun\n\n* Ensure that the referenced folio-style values have defaults\n\n* build: Fix placement of db block in application yml\n\n* fix: Job runner error\n\n* fix: Revert accidental change to application yml defaults\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Steve Osguthorpe <steve.osguthorpe@k-int.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQ