t_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-20T14:02:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Keep \"internal\" entitlements with type = null for now -- ERM-3795 (#946)\n\nInternal entitlements historically had a null type. The comments elsewhere in the code suggested that `internal` was an acceptable value, but this causes frontend issues\n\nFor now, simply revert to using `null` here for our logic, but eventually this needs a proper rethink. String value for something logic or rendering keys off is a terrible idea\n\nrefs ERM-3795","tree":{"sha":"dbf56ed4887ce6a5f6100ad536b7e3f18a52b1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/trees/dbf56ed4887ce6a5f6100ad536b7e3f18a52b1a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/commits/91ef853bc8b4bf9938405d8296eb92bad7888a34","verification":{"payload":"tree dbf56ed4887ce6a5f6100ad536b7e3f18a52b1a0\nparent c299a02855a7534da148e975284ba4fca22117dd\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1760968938 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1760968938 +0100\n\nfix: Keep \"internal\" entitlements with type = null for now -- ERM-3795 (#946)\n\nInternal entitlements historically had a null type. The comments elsewhere in the code suggested that `internal` was an acceptable value, but this causes frontend issues\n\nFor now, simply revert to using `null` here for our logic, but eventually this needs a proper rethink. String value for something logic or rendering keys off is a terrible idea\n\nrefs ERM-3795","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo9kDqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC7MQAD7hkqj70CMw8iKCO7Vk7xH8\nqisfIhszWkwFNO7yj2nTiGVWAD53TufQigioPIP5VAL/3VDXSiO91XqRPekH9tcD\nT82AOmkBctqtFfra6WPrzIYsqSi1YodVh1CO1xhMKhzNiaPaX/iCjG4YjN2DNZ39\nB08v6R++WZnrVTcJZcos56KBhPGgJ1MOBn+UbYpgAUUohnxFEnv1zbLN6y+MGvSv\nAlpfJ1+93ypyJbd83m+1vmzGExheXbULH6QSGJ0K8l6yQcDwG7Z32mMudV5Eamlf\nXE90mCo1bNUivONawSS9km0DulswWD2P4qnl