mits/91ef853bc8b4bf9938405d8296eb92bad7888a34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54310740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EthanFreestone","id":54310740,"login":"EthanFreestone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzEwNzQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EthanFreestone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/commits/c299a02855a7534da148e975284ba4fca22117dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-17T16:53:32Z","email":"54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com","name":"EthanFreestone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-17T16:53:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add Acquisition Units filter to Agreement search -- ERM-3783 (#945)\n\n* feat: PoliciesFilter\n\nAdded new class, PoliciesFilter, which houses simply a List<AccessPolicies>\n\nThis class will be used to group filters and provide additional SQL to further restrict the list of resources based on access policy objects in the implementing system\n\nAlso updated diagram\n\n* feat(WIP): Add filtering SQL builder logic directly into AccessPolicyAwareController\n\nAdded logic to directly construct a SQL fragment corresponding to the List<PoliciesFilter> we get from query params\n\nCurrently not working though, and NEEDS to be moved to PolicyEngine\n\nI''d also like to rename AccessPolicies, AccessPolicy etc etc for clarity\n\n* refactor(WIP): Moved all Policy filtering stuff into the policyEngine itself\n\nMoved the filter work into a special FilterPolicySubquery, implementing the PolicySubquery interface\n\nThis combines the pre-existing work to get SQL from a parameter set with the filter building logic, and implements that directly into the PolicyEngine.\n\nWhen attempting to getSql, implementors can now include List<PoliciesFilter> to additionally implement a filter subquery\n\nThis is ONLY implemented for AccessPolicyAwareController::index in the grails layer\n\n* fix: AccessPolicies Type should be quoted in the resultant SQL\n\n* fix: Ensure we actually filter on the AccessPolicies FOR the resources at hand\n\n* docs: Javadoc comments\n\n* refactor: Renamed some classes and interfaces for clarity\n\nPolicy -> IExternalPolicy\nAccessPolicy -> IDomainAccessPolicy\nAccessPolicies -> GroupedExternalPolicyList\n\n* docs: Updated AccessControl diagram\n\n* refactor: GroupedExternalPolicies\n\nRenamed GroupedExternalPolicyList -> GroupedExternalPolicies\n\n* test: Added a test for FilterPolicySubquery\n\n* test: Add test cases for AcquisitionUnitPolicySubquery\n\nAI made this test, I''ve just tweaked it, and I''m not 100% sure I''m happy with it. But bad tests are better than no tests...?\n\n* refactor: Renamed interfaces\n\nIDomainAccessPolicy -> DomainAccessPolicy\nIExternalPolicy -> ExternalPolicy\n\n* test: Added FolioClientTest\n\nTweaked dependencies to ensure we can parameterise tests, then set up unit test for FolioClient","tree":{"sha":"942d4d77028bef6446f2363a847a75c1c31466cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/trees/942d4d77028bef6446f2363a847a75c1c31466cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-agreements/git/commits/c299a02855a7534da148e975284ba4fca22117dd","verification":{"payload":"tree 942d4d77028bef6446f2363a847a75c1c31466cf\nparent 962f11dce1a878bf634ac0e985ea2aa61e42a488\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1760720012 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1760720012 +0100\n\nfeat: Add Acquisition Units filter to Agreement search -- ERM-3783 (#945)\n\n* feat: PoliciesFilter\n\nAdded new class, PoliciesFilter, which houses simply a List<AccessPolicies>\n\nThis class will be used to group filters and provide additional SQL to further restrict the list of resources based on access policy objects in the implementing system\n\nAlso updated diagram\n\n* feat(WIP): Add filtering SQL builder logic directly into AccessPolicyAwareController\n\nAdded logic to directly construct a SQL fragment corresponding to the List<PoliciesFilter> we get from query params\n\nCurrently not working though, and NEEDS to be moved to PolicyEngine\n\nI''d also like to rename AccessPolicies, AccessPolicy etc etc for clarity\n\n* refactor(WIP): Moved all Policy filtering stuff into the policyEngine itself\n\nMoved the filter work into a special FilterPolicySubquery, implementing the PolicySubquery interface\n\nThis combines the pre-existing work to get SQL from a parameter set with the filter building logic, and implements that directly into the PolicyEngine.\n\nWhen attempting to getSql, implementors can now include List<PoliciesFilter> to additionally implement a filter subquery\n\nThis is ONLY implemented for AccessPolicyAwareController::index in the grails layer\n\n* fix: AccessPolicies Type should be quoted in the resultant SQL\n\n* fix: Ensure we actually filter on the AccessPolicies FOR the resources at hand\n\n* docs: Javadoc comments\n\n* refactor: Renamed some classes and interfaces for clarity\n\nPolicy -> IExternalPolicy\nAccessPolicy -> IDomainAccessPolicy\nAccessPolicies -> GroupedExternalPolicyList\n\n* docs: Updated AccessControl diagram\n\n* refactor: GroupedExternalPolicies\n\nRenamed G