-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/68a3d84505de33737cb823c97d9fd51f1e509408/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:18:45Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:18:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(theme): prevent Felt theme flicker while feature flags load (#3726)\n\nRHCLOUD-52003\nApply pf-v6-theme-felt in the blocking head bootstrap script on all\nroutes so the Felt theme is present before PatternFly CSS loads.\nIn the Header, treat platform.chrome-felt-auto as enabled while\nUnleash flags are still resolving, then follow the actual flag value\nonce ready. This eliminates the brief flash of non-Felt styles on\ninitial page load.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e969f2dc7ed34b352dd39d0004fee2d34fdd4c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/0e969f2dc7ed34b352dd39d0004fee2d34fdd4c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/68a3d84505de33737cb823c97d9fd51f1e509408","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e969f2dc7ed34b352dd39d0004fee2d34fdd4c4\nparent d0f72e3b510bd5591caaa105e661a4ab9615ecfe\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1791458325 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791458325 +0200\n\nfix(theme): prevent Felt theme flicker while feature flags load (#3726)\n\nRHCLOUD-52003\nApply pf-v6-theme-felt in the blocking head bootstrap script on all\nroutes so the Felt theme is present before PatternFly CSS loads.\nIn the Header, treat platform.chrome-felt-auto as enabled while\nUnleash flags are still resolving, then follow the actual flag value\nonce ready. This eliminates the brief flash of non-