hored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* docs: document feature-flag outage guidance\n\nDocument warning-level handling for toggle HTTP failures, exception-level reporting for request failures, and the invariants that agents should preserve when changing feature-flag visibility.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(e2e): isolate feature flag storage\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>","tree":{"sha":"d14284ac2c695b95ae4eff35ce3ac19d1dd1d64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/d14284ac2c695b95ae4eff35ce3ac19d1dd1d64c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/7591e82be4ee6f98db669bd8d37a96efe8aecdf4","verification":{"payload":"tree d14284ac2c695b95ae4eff35ce3ac19d1dd1d64c\nparent 8bc1c8f141192460cba28dd90e7af0c2d7587ab8\nauthor Petr Šimon <psimon@redhat.com> 1791202577 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791202577 +0200\n\nHandle Unleash failures without breaking navigation RHCLOUD-51464 (#3702)\n\n* fix(feature-flags): handle Unleash outages safely\n\nIgnore metrics failures when reporting feature-flag health, preserve fallback visibility during outages, scope cached toggles by identity, and allow longer background refresh timeouts. Ensure GlobalFilter can resolve permissions when feature flags fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* docs: document feature-flag outage guidance\n\nDocument warning-level handling for toggle HTTP failures, exception-level reporting for request failures, and the invariants that agents should preserve when changing feature-flag visibility.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(e2e): isolate feature flag storage\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: gpt-6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw5URCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOeMQAGH