3881b68abb369e049ab8a6a1f5fd7828b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:48:35Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:48:35Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(ci): accept redhat.atlassian.net URLs in PR validation\n\nRHCLOUD-51824\nThe Jira PR reference validator only accepted issues.redhat.com URLs,\nrejecting the equivalent redhat.atlassian.net form. Both hostnames\nresolve to the same Jira instance. Updated the URL patterns to\ntolerate either hostname and expanded the test suite to 14 cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"423ad6d7312cdeb34cdcbb2fc35522e8983093c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/423ad6d7312cdeb34cdcbb2fc35522e8983093c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/ac745d83881b68abb369e049ab8a6a1f5fd7828b","verification":{"payload":"tree 423ad6d7312cdeb34cdcbb2fc35522e8983093c1\nparent b10d7777198cad2663e10fa79a3e6880329c7350\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790887715 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790887715 +0000\n\nfix(ci): accept redhat.atlassian.net URLs in PR validation\n\nRHCLOUD-51824\nThe Jira PR reference validator only accepted issues.redhat.com URLs,\nrejecting the equivalent redhat.atlassian.net form. Both hostnames\nresolve to the same Jira instance. Updated the URL patterns to\ntolerate either hostname and expanded the test suite to 14 cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCar7HIwAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7tS1AP9by4xv1ImxVkUyuM6B2yAxYwFLlajUEZz6e/7OiYrjSgD7BblvREmE6H6r\nG28Nr5flqRVVHrLRDLZoVu7gGSMR+w8=\n=CnJ7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verifi