om>","tree":{"sha":"3660e6737b7854d8c4df68115b52748e0f9a3f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/3660e6737b7854d8c4df68115b52748e0f9a3f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/4dedf8e3ef643917eb8e60e17940dfe08ab7a44c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3660e6737b7854d8c4df68115b52748e0f9a3f63\nparent 21a4442553973c66848839a03bbc79932d4b6860\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790784945 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790792092 +0000\n\nrefactor(tests): separate e2e and integration Playwright tests\n\nRHCLOUD-51761\n\nMove 6 test files that use mocks/stubs from playwright/e2e/ to\nplaywright/integration/: amplitude-autocapture, color-scheme,\ncontrast-mode, theme-toggle, last-visited-pages, rbac-v2-gating.\n\nTests using page.route(), route.fulfill(), mockFeatureFlags(), or\nfixture data are now categorized as integration tests. Pure user\nflow tests remain in e2e/. Both sets still run during CI via\n`npm run playwright`. New npm scripts added for running each\ncategory independently.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCar1RnAAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7hLMAQC8pUHJ/nzOb3yMBA9UgjrrmWX2su5C389YABhEp+AH5gEA02ZMP/pPzJSe\nblOSQQlC5jVftiTMgLAlN+UhtWM5kwo=\n=m9d2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T18:15:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bo