b.com/users/tahmidefaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tahmidefaz","id":17099954,"login":"tahmidefaz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDk5OTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahmidefaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/58ef09f250c58433097c4a6d217864c36488c1ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:08:56Z","email":"17099954+tahmidefaz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tahmid Efaz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:08:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(e2e): force platform.chrome-felt-auto off in theme-toggle test (#3714)\n\nTools.tsx hides the entire Theme settings section whenever\nplatform.chrome-felt-auto is enabled (added in #3713). The\ntheme-toggle e2e test only mocked platform.chrome.felt-theme, so\nplatform.chrome-felt-auto passed through the live stage Unleash\nresponse unmocked — when stage returns it enabled, the Theme section\nnever renders and #theme-default/#theme-felt time out.\n\nExtend mockFeatureFlags with an optional disabledFlags list and use\nit to force platform.chrome-felt-auto off for this test.","tree":{"sha":"e94aa59a57e6cf190a171d163d4faa98082a8095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/e94aa59a57e6cf190a171d163d4faa98082a8095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/58ef09f250c58433097c4a6d217864c36488c1ce","verification":{"payload":"tree e94aa59a57e6cf190a171d163d4faa98082a8095\nparent 8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae\nauthor Tahmid Efaz <17099954+tahmidefaz@users.noreply.github.com> 1790784536 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790784536 -0400\n\nfix(e2e): force platform.chrome-felt-auto off in theme-toggle test (#3714)\n\nTools.tsx hides the entire Theme settings section whenever\nplatform.chrome-felt-auto is enabled (added in #3713). The\ntheme-toggle e2e test only mocked platform.chrome.felt-theme, so\nplatform.chrome-felt-auto passed through the live stage Unleash\nresponse unmocked — when stage returns it enabled, the Theme section\nnever renders and #theme-default/#theme-felt time out.\n\nExtend mockFeatureFlags with an optional disabledFlags list and use\nit to force platform.chrome-felt-auto off for this test.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTQZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANE4QAEM7lyr+ewvmduyps0YEdemk\nmtTRp5BbYOKGpaPE+AhwTgk5vD+opy5MFajHxv34BeSuMxHg94LsX7/9J8+99FuY\nfEmEOMQyUJXjLoCpABCyrXXF3Fjio9DNh2clhMwVvTw/Ne0VRsSkjUiszAu+sv30\nToJM0QQ5XbgJVS82Lp5SBv8Z/PL2SMcZquZcPZiSOnA8f7zdpDqDf8xH6ves8sVz\nY7ktCgg2whYXnMHMLRUpn/ylenw2jhmTCHGSRqMZL89RDWUCrHrcJi7vF/p+wQLt\nPGXOyTa5heUeyyeVc+zDNtl6GkJqVVI9fgQrafklZ5Ru41CP+mvb5P7lGJiP5yZG\noyLYzJ9bq+34+ej6zrghai4Eq6crn1wxAJIbL8ya4VHVsaA8rqKOYlKuBWYXRSQd\nvMd+DdEDYxjk9muYHJF9zmuN4oMI3/mz8+93VyNbe+tAWmwVojriB0U1qSiZwVvl\nlT9s5tAyo+M0QHXZdct5SsiMTfL/TrN4qk7bRs7aPPOOAsSbPcd1PU07LgfrRn55\n6RRV35e43MajLzYCkFJThTuGVHwbyRC3m2qEXfrDc6wB78FkVX9xQa2tWN4AtyqY\n9TkDJQcgZdxptz0onX46pQ4IU/fjYemJ37ma+2PTJbHim/cuEWJ9kgyPBp1GNHuL\nPCY/vzPLut8FYOVli3cZ\n=swc4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:08:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-f