eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:25:59Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:25:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(theme): auto-enable Felt theme via platform.chrome-felt-auto flag (#3713)\n\nRHCLOUD-51752\n\nWhen the platform.chrome-felt-auto feature flag is enabled, the Felt\ntheme is automatically applied without user interaction and the Felt\ntheme switcher is completely hidden from the settings dropdown.\n\nExisting behavior is preserved when the auto flag is disabled: the\nmanual Felt theme toggle continues to work as before. Dark mode,\nhigh-contrast, and glass contrast controls remain unaffected. Lightwell\nforced Felt behavior is also preserved.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18600f651fb70bc0791a37f11e8f48a632abbe98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/18600f651fb70bc0791a37f11e8f48a632abbe98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 18600f651fb70bc0791a37f11e8f48a632abbe98\nparent 574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790763959 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790763959 +0200\n\nfeat(theme): auto-enable Felt theme via platform.chrome-felt-auto flag (#3713)\n\nRHCLOUD-51752\n\nWhen the platform.chrome-felt-auto feature flag is enabled, the Felt\ntheme is automatically applied without user interaction and the Felt\ntheme switcher is completely hidden from the settings dropdown.\n\nExisting behavior is preserved when the auto flag is disabled: the\nmanual Felt theme toggle continues to work as before. Dark mode,\nhigh-contrast, and glass contrast controls remain unaffected. Lightwell\nforced Felt behavior is also preserved.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOO3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGVsQAEBkk+v4ey2TmBidvL1srsU1\nkPoKpfPL7zFrqIDpKAeQgv2p3XTETmrmvewLuSy6AZrKy2Topx3W4z7gbOl7Hcke\naFSrO1mEZobY/u/QJFu226AVnSICa+dFfLPY7wJkaNci2n8rvaZgVAZD33BDCLkV\n9VwrsMHQ63CcSFZi3YfctCaf5eNygD+z1p3+37ybj/Jp92sIwV5F10lintmxFbYK\nzzL0wEXcbL+spvzCIvLnLJ5XZRegTRmK7Oqg8Iqx07eHWpLiTN1x8eos/Cv56fFL\nUsQhgytRzDGgsuMmIbkUikrzCjYVr2cniTTgud/mI5wHRGLQI9oeJuo2OZIR+lab\nprguSmzF5t5S7m1prgYvmH4ZhC0uaFJDu1L8VoKVZ7AhXUYJVdELSRJk7SS1ahp9\nYGfAq1it76AdqhRQEqoZPHg6B+GHtNx3hLO1UYnBR1mdocQXjitnL9ermpDqLVVJ\nFqxwLIyKddwgzExOpknvj0H7vVAfX2XyVFWlkT/D3ZvIGM2xvVpz+A56Q8o6VxFm\nW03U7FMI+PUmHt2ULplbq5RnWEE/CpTygZodVgL546Tv+RDfSzSDy2rKk8FAFgoF\ncAbGd25YxyKhYMjA74Rk6dmj4n2BcJQVqGoTo6fENYRJA/l5Sfc1SqoPNlBdtt3i\nOwDFHZfVJ7ZM1Pn+8ZYw\n=0yc1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:26:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commit/8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae","node_id":"C_kwDOB89ZFdoAKDgxMDdmYzJmZTU0OTZjZDcwYzU0MTBkZmRjNGNhZTg0M2E5NGM1YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commit/574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b","sha":"574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b"}],"sha":"8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/8107fc2fe5496cd70c5410dfdc4cae843a94c5ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petrsimon","id":286291,"login":"petrsimon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjI5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:37:26Z","email":"psimon@redhat.com","name":"Petr Šimon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:37:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(auth): pin SSO fallback for malformed live config (#3706)\n\nA malformed 200 response from sso-config-generated.json must fall back\nto the hostname-aware DEFAULT_SSO_ROUTES. Returning it as live data sends\nconsole.redhat.com users to stage SSO or crashes resolveSSOUrl.\n\nRefs https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHCLOUD-51664\n\nCo-authored-by: Bryan Florkiewicz <bflorkie@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"8df7ea7ba26ea8040b3e855ea3cf9ce25143d00f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/8df7ea7ba26ea8040b3e855ea3cf9ce25143d00f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/574d8477750d5369ee13d583a276f57bba008d9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 8df7ea7ba26ea8040b3e855ea3cf9ce25143d00f\nparent 0f00f059ef1fa725c3f8aac93445305435c074ef\nauthor Petr Šimon <psimon@redhat.com> 1790753846 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790753846 +0200\n\ntest(auth): pin SSO fallback for malformed live config (#3706)\n\nA malformed 200 response from sso-config-generated.json must fall back\nto the hostname-aware DEFAULT_SSO_ROUTES. Returning it as live data sends\nconsole.redhat.com users to stage SSO or crashes resolveSSOUrl.\n\nRefs https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHCLOUD-51664\n\nCo-authored-by: Bryan Florkiewicz <bflorkie@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvLw2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlAsQAKCWSFAF7jrMN/Sv8YOz4Oxv\nDdCz4t8T8j3joQfAI7cgIXzdGRP/o5pmTHGEg4G4ROy9Eh6Z9F0eCyvLnoNJ4f8n\n9KjA1wZPSOoPdhZDqJ9vQrEFuHEJbng7AYqQN+eSJ6HK5UAZksHjCX7zETsDaBVf\n8JRAilfFSp3goZhFNhAovmEzCiLVda1oHgDbhPI