"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/faf6b494318f825c39ace019c39f204e6010c629/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:21:57Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:46:06Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(ci): extract OCI trusted artifacts as non-root\n\nApply the V2 pipeline security patterns to the use-trusted-artifact\nstep so that files are extracted as UID 1000 instead of root.  This\nprevents permission errors when the subsequent e2e-tests step runs\nas pwuser (1000:1000).\n\nKey changes aligned with docker-build-run-all-tests-v2:\n- securityContext on use-trusted-artifact (runAsUser/Group 1000)\n- TAR_OPTIONS to skip restoring the volume mount-point root entry\n- HOME set via env var (not inline export) for writable npm caches\n- allowPrivilegeEscalation: false on all steps\n\nRHCLOUD-51354\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a35c93924b4cbff97c97e4e0c92f135c8656a5c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/a35c93924b4cbff97c97e4e0c92f135c8656a5c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/faf6b494318f825c39ace019c39f204e6010c629","verification":{"payload":"tree a35c93924b4cbff97c97e4e0c92f135c8656a5c4\nparent 2f568b664990d4024e566f1313c6e78dcd46b2bb\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790612517 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790707566 +0000\n\nfix(ci): extract OCI trusted artifacts as non-root\n\nApply the V2 pipeline security patterns to the use-trusted-artifact\nstep so that files are extracted as UID 1000 instead of root.  This\nprevents permission errors when the subsequent e2e-tests step runs\nas pwuser (1000:1000).\n\nKey changes aligned with docker-build-run-all-tests-v2:\n- securityContext on use-trusted-artifact (runAsUser/Group 1000)\n- TAR_OPTIONS to skip restoring the volume mount-point root entry\n- HOME set via env var (not inline export) for writable npm caches\n- allowPrivilegeEscalation: false on all steps\n\nRHCLOUD-51354\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCarwHbgAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7qGkAP422JFbkwZosdhXKPELgfwvDfk5rkTEweVkc9DAQu6HYwD/Xgii5V+OcR79\naA2usS3AwwxVMZmoUSmodnn4TIPllgI=\n=pwkk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T18:46:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commit/faf6b494318f825c39ace019c39f204e6010c629","node_id":"C_kwDOB89ZFdoAKGZhZjZiNDk0MzE4ZjgyNWMzOWFjZTAxOWMzOWYyMDRlNjAxMGM2Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commit/2f568b664990d4024e566f1313c6e78dcd46b2bb",