s/4fd297e332be5cd4b7ff21bce9d93fe647527dca"}],"sha":"062c78d0b79491062712d3e004c8bc314d04b669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/062c78d0b79491062712d3e004c8bc314d04b669"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/4fd297e332be5cd4b7ff21bce9d93fe647527dca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T08:26:34Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T08:26:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(lightwell): remove pf-6-next alias (RHCLOUD-51453) (#3695)\n\n* fix(lightwell): remove pf-6-next alias, restore shared PF Page import\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\n\nRemove the temporary pf-6-next npm alias (prerelease PF 6.6) now that\nthe shared @patternfly/react-core is at 6.6.1 stable. Revert Lightwell\nPage component to use the shared copy''s API (no isPlain prop or\nPageFooter yet in stable), restoring footer-as-sibling layout with\nthe corresponding SCSS flex rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lightwell): restore footer element wrapper in LightwellFooter\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\nRestore the <footer> semantic wrapper around the links list.\nWhen the pf-6-next alias was removed and footer reverted from\nPage''s footer prop to a sibling, the <footer> element was\ninadvertently dropped. Restoring it keeps proper semantics\nfor the footer-as-sibling layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lightwell): use getByRole query for footer assertion\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\nReplace container.querySelector(''footer'') with\nscreen.getByRole(''contentinfo'') per Testing Library best practices.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Petr Šimon <psimon@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2040f4168ec65982ad7478cc96b53d90fd224e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/b2040f4168ec65982ad7478cc96b53d90fd224e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/4fd297e332be5cd4b7ff21bce9d93fe647527dca","verification":{"payload":"tree b2040f4168ec65982ad7478cc96b53d90fd224e0\nparent 526089ab73ea59fa1af8d1e9a1469d9a75b163e0\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790670394 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790670394 +0200\n\nfix(lightwell): remove pf-6-next alias (RHCLOUD-51453) (#3695)\n\n* fix(lightwell): remove pf-6-next alias, restore shared PF Page import\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\n\nRemove the temporary pf-6-next npm alias (prerelease PF 6.6) now that\nthe shared @patternfly/react-core is at 6.6.1 stable. Revert Lightwell\nPage component to use the shared copy''s API (no isPlain prop or\nPageFooter yet in stable), restoring footer-as-sibling layout with\nthe corresponding SCSS flex rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lightwell): restore footer element wrapper in LightwellFooter\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\nRestore the <footer> semantic wrapper around the links list.\nWhen the pf-6-next alias was removed and footer reverted from\nPage''s footer prop to a sibling, the <footer> element was\ninadvertently dropped. Restoring it keeps proper semantics\nfor the footer-as-sibling layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lightwell): use getByRole query for footer assertion\n\nRHCLOUD-51453\nReplace container.querySelector(''footer'') with\nscreen.getByRole(''contentinfo'') per Testing Library best practices.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Petr Šimon <psimon@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu3Y6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtLAQAHE7Y09c+3MGAQ6ANGpHMdEx\nQCRdEAeZOK6cP/rjyXJlIdfVLuLnNOqgAvTiLcO6S0BM0TYKyj2GTvt83/pmJFvx\ni30Pd4Cw1j7rEVp3GZDin/pwsySuIrfMsQBWUSwtqjmjr4N1hkqaoDi3prv9erCo\n/uoaL/EpVA/CElczO36T6ACOyEd9q+JPcOSa2yiqbV9n8Oe7dlMladUEP46vJxVz\nB6AXEKXQe7pHdCVDFQyqvQLDfQotdckk4JB8aKL+0i9HW8dJXbKgpaNzSk/J2L5P\nCH0tcQrfWSE2kFj88FEZteGVsP+waeopriesi8FzZFIhmKe0kzZHP0xInXouVhwT\neslHAieEUd4wpr0uSMhNqzu6q2G3YG/hHyzwNUdYy86QBPJ5/CZ4d/QwZ6iu3Q63\n+2C4kvCJ7J/i+sWCkTfc7pSRpaFVVoV1XYd3kk2Q/qeMPXB0euZfx+bQ6J0XADRV\nrbV/eUV8O2NU8FHptG/j+OMt2Se8ZBCzxoVfSOn35/1CQnVNCU/iarLn6TlJ02CR\nJLBnO64uUEyCSJN5epcFSNdoS7HAjTFkD88KcI7Hu8TaBJyqA/fxH7pweFUFkNNH\nYKSBFDQPJGHFy9+fXRiD5449ckwt/PUWkp5RoUaQ3pLqd3FvOJi1cI8ZaUyMRfsq\nleZ/gTxB3dNEnAlLej+j\n=64nn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T08:26:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c