trsimon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petrsimon","id":286291,"login":"petrsimon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjI5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petrsimon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/commits/7f1b040ed0286f1e52eb118dab9cd6c88f223da9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T06:58:30Z","email":"psimon@redhat.com","name":"Petr Šimon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T06:58:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix Chrome cache fallback reliability (#3685)\n\n* fix(cache): report persistent config fallback degradation\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* fix(cache): preserve generated navigation snapshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(cache): cover browser cache fallback behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* feat(cache): gate generated config fallback behind feature flag\n\nExtend network-first IndexedDB fallback coverage to generated configuration sources consumed by Chrome. Gate persistent fallback storage behind platform.chrome.config-cache-fallback for post-authenticated requests, keep bootstrap fallback explicitly enabled, and remove the unused build-time bootstrap toggle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(playwright): classify cache fallback as integration\n\nMove deterministic generated-configuration cache coverage out of the live E2E suite and include the integration directory in Playwright discovery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* fixup! feat(cache): gate generated config fallback behind feature flag\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>","tree":{"sha":"e30f140ab247453236d8befa65f0824c17be4e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/trees/e30f140ab247453236d8befa65f0824c17be4e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-chrome/git/commits/7f1b040ed0286f1e52eb118dab9cd6c88f223da9","verification":{"payload":"tree e30f140ab247453236d8befa65f0824c17be4e13\nparent 29418f82548a589bc891e733b6f9a13fa5d24709\nauthor Petr Šimon <psimon@redhat.com> 1790060310 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790060310 +0200\n\nFix Chrome cache fallback reliability (#3685)\n\n* fix(cache): report persistent config fallback degradation\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* fix(cache): preserve generated navigation snapshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(cache): cover browser cache fallback behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* feat(cache): gate generated config fallback behind feature flag\n\nExtend network-first IndexedDB fallback coverage to generated configuration sources consumed by Chrome. Gate persistent fallback storage behind platform.chrome.config-cache-fallback for post-authenticated requests, keep bootstrap fallback explicitly enabled, and remove the unused build-time bootstrap toggle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* test(playwright): classify cache fallback as integration\n\nMove deterministic generated-configuration cache coverage out of the live E2E suite and include the integration directory in Playwright discovery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: gpt-5.6-luna <noreply@pi.dev>\n\n* fixup! feat(cache): gate generated config 