github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/commits/c9f5bdbcd27066c67a0c0016d5bfc68f3e3b4409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:45:03Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:45:03Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(playwright): move disableCookiePrompt to shared fixture\n\nRHCLOUD-51825\ndisableCookiePrompt uses page.route() — a per-page network interceptor\nthat cannot persist through storageState. Instead of calling it manually\nin every spec, create a custom test fixture in test-utils.ts that\napplies it automatically to each page instance. Specs now import test\nfrom ./test-utils instead of @playwright/test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af5c00ff85daf51d137e10d1aca8f394805ba863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/af5c00ff85daf51d137e10d1aca8f394805ba863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/c9f5bdbcd27066c67a0c0016d5bfc68f3e3b4409","verification":{"payload":"tree af5c00ff85daf51d137e10d1aca8f394805ba863\nparent 677705e84a34da81bc3a17a5df781a37da1c01fe\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790963103 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790963103 +0000\n\nfix(playwright): move disableCookiePrompt to shared fixture\n\nRHCLOUD-51825\ndisableCookiePrompt uses page.route() — a per-page network interceptor\nthat cannot persist through storageState. Instead of calling it manually\nin every spec, create a custom test fixture in test-utils.ts that\napplies it automatically to each page instance. Specs now import test\nfrom ./test-utils instead of @playwright/test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <nore