ed by PR #812.","tree":{"sha":"103496f0a9b97d3e12a484cd6409f73fd88f2fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/103496f0a9b97d3e12a484cd6409f73fd88f2fa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/31b5e5218d8a82d450b6a9b1d2236ccd0ef1646a","verification":{"payload":"tree 103496f0a9b97d3e12a484cd6409f73fd88f2fa0\nparent 7e92033ce71e162bd3d24ec47561348dd4086247\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790958022 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790958022 +0000\n\nfix(e2e): use shared auth package in CI, keep proxy setup for local dev\n\nRHCLOUD-51825\nUse playwright-test-auth global-setup in CI (no E2E_PROXY) and keep the\nlocal proxy-aware setup for environments that need it. Remove duplicated\nlogin logic from global-setup-with-proxy — delegate to the shared\npackage''s login() helper. Share react-router-dom as singleton so Chrome\nand the app use the same router context. Skip flaky replace-mode\nbreadcrumb tests until underlying issues are resolved.\n\nInspired by PR #812.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCar/ZxgAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7hyfAP0Wr0w2pyzUah35BZX+is6EpT6pPHv77ogdQS71W7xYrAD+MHXlhQq93xdf\nl1r6CYcm/IPL/vEtaxXVE9ndme85Fgg=\n=5CCT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T16:20:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","org