751?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catastrophe-brandon","id":20647751,"login":"catastrophe-brandon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjQ3NzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/commits/ee325958950d9f31b537a08685f9f273f6a7f69f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:28:15Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:28:15Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"message":"Simplify Tekton nop-image guard for Caddy script\n\nRevert to simpler approach - if Caddy isn''t found, assume we''re in a Tekton\nnop image and exit gracefully. The previous attempt at smart detection with\nexplicit nop-image signals was causing false positives. Simpler is better here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d78f60b05b4ecfb3b9902ceb62444ecf2276dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/2d78f60b05b4ecfb3b9902ceb62444ecf2276dd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/ee325958950d9f31