api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/commits/6032191a6a7e2bf916508885fb258e8eca9c86b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:09:29Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:09:29Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"message":"Improve Tekton nop-image detection in Caddy guard\n\nUpdate the run-app-script to explicitly check for Tekton nop-image signals\nbefore exiting gracefully. Previously, any missing caddy command would exit 0,\nwhich could mask configuration errors. Now fails fast (exit 1) when Caddy is\nmissing outside of a Tekton nop-image context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d720ecb7cbacbb87b646d247776d58dd3856b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/1d720ecb7cbacbb87b646d247776d58dd3856b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/6032191a6a7e2bf916508885fb258e8eca9c86b7","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d720ecb7cbacbb87b646d247776d58dd3856b84\nparent 2f28b68e904ddc2c71fbd35c113826dd209ec198\nauthor Darth Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1784236169 -0500\ncommitter Darth Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1784236169 -0500\n\nImprove Tekton nop-image detection in Caddy guard\n\nUpdate the run-app-script to explicitly check for Tekton nop-image signals\nbefore exiting gracefully. Previously, any missing caddy command would exit 0,\nwhich could mask configuration errors. Now fails fast (exit 1) whe