"2026-04-08T17:52:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RHCLOUD-46356: test: integrate playwright-test-auth package for e2e authentication (#764)\n\n* test: integrate playwright-test-auth package for e2e authentication\n\nReplaces custom login implementation with @redhat-cloud-services/playwright-test-auth package to centralize and standardize authentication handling across e2e tests.\n\nChanges:\n- Add @redhat-cloud-services/playwright-test-auth package\n- Configure global setup for one-time authentication\n- Use storageState to reuse auth session across tests\n- Simplify test files by removing custom login/cookie helpers\n- Add playwright/.auth to .gitignore\n- Update documentation with new authentication strategy\n\nBenefits:\n- Faster test execution (auth once vs per test)\n- Simplified test code (50+ lines to 8 lines in beforeEach)\n- Reusable authentication utilities\n- Consistent auth handling across test suite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update @playwright/test to 1.59.1\n\nUpdate Playwright to the latest version for compatibility and latest features.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update Playwright Docker image to 1.59.1 in Tekton pipeline\n\nUpdate the e2e-playwright-image parameter in the pull request pipeline to use Playwright 1.59.1, matching the npm package version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18c8bf59b3f5dd7a9c60001b0ba441311faed408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/18c8bf59b3f5dd7a9c60001b0ba441311faed408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/3799c92c2bcdf73abf679e5fe10ac50f9dcdbe6d","verification":{"payload":"tree 18c8bf59b3f5dd7a9c60001b0ba441311faed408\nparent 9fa2290d410e29395ae2664ab71b2416f809c711\nauthor Brandon Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1775670763 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775670763 -0500\n\nRHCLOUD-46356: test: integrate playwright-test-auth package for e2e authentication (#764)\n\n* test: integrate playwright-test-auth package for e2e authentication\n\nReplaces custom login implementation with @redhat-cloud-services/playwright-test-auth package to centralize and standardize authentication handling across e2e tests.\n\nChanges:\n- Add @redhat-cloud-services/playwright-test-auth package\n- Configure global setup for one-time authentication\n- Use storageState to reuse auth session across tests\n- Simplify test files by removing custom login/cookie helpers\n- Add playwright/.auth to .gitignore\n- Update documentation with new authentication strategy\n\nBenefits:\n- Faster test execution (auth once vs per test)\n- Simplified test code (50+ lines to 8 lines in beforeEach)\n- Reusable authentication utilities\n- Consistent auth handling across test suite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update @playwright/test to 1.59.1\n\nUpdate Playwright to the latest version for compatibility and latest features.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update Playwright Docker image to 1.59.1 in Tekton pipeline\n\nUpdate the e2e-playwright-image parameter in the pull request pipeline to use Playwright 1.59.1, matching the npm package version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1pXrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmQEQACoTDnUQzNDcoQs8NjGsakAI\nIh+fSc8n0TT7qT+KjdwKczW9+twtyn6ZqiG7ZDP2qCMzpdOdLxW9C/uNYnk9NSbh\n9OIIUahLlg5CpQ0wUuZPhg5b1i2d/6ke35UbGQfHrE8HdXCPdDP6mHr9LeTN2L2s\nUmK8Lkz6ZfmK6qd1ZgL5xGSbyYoT/uInOrmPzeTJiRwY6SbTox2j7mxlCkSMjsty\n8LSlmIXOiVvjtUivNmKxXtFM/Y1FiWkcd2r4YoyMzVTh2wmogSHDXeiPOEd7UGMP\njL8Cwlf+tAlqVsnx1Dh0KAoV2xWqb0LHAfd8D79gNPI