61a2b1a80e8df8b096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/commits/07dc64b7076d623768f57861a2b1a80e8df8b096"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20647751?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catastrophe-brandon","id":20647751,"login":"catastrophe-brandon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjQ3NzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/commits/05a63a0a3a3bdd892c7ca13597b94049e240f7e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T18:52:56Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Brandon Tweed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T18:52:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RHCLOUD-44853: Update pipeline to use v2 ConfigMaps and remove chrome sidecar (#737)\n\n* Update pipeline to use v2 ConfigMaps and remove chrome sidecar\n\nUpdate the pull request pipeline to align with the new shared konflux\npipeline definition that removes the insights-chrome-dev sidecar.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove chrome-port parameter (was 9912)\n- Rename test-app-port to e2e-app-port\n- Remove test-app-name parameter\n- Update frontend-proxy-routes-configmap to use -v2 suffix\n- Update pipeline reference to catastrophe-brandon/konflux-pipelines commit fda9a7ea\n- Remove taskRunSpecs section (sidecar configuration now handled by pipeline)\n\nThe new architecture routes all requests directly to the application\ncontainer, simplifying the pipeline execution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add hostAliases for stage.foo.redhat.com in E2E tests\n\nAdd hostAliases configuration to properly resolve stage.foo.redhat.com\nto localhost in the E2E test pod. This is the Kubernetes-native way to\nconfigure /etc/hosts entries.\n\nWithout this configuration, getent hosts stage.foo.redhat.com fails\nand the E2E tests cannot connect to the frontend-dev-proxy sidecar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"264a59caf16a741934ea526b96d04dca406d6aa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/trees/264a59caf16a741934ea526b96d04dca406d6aa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-starter-app/git/commits/05a63a0a3a3bdd892c7ca13597b94049e240f7e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 264a59caf16a741934ea526b96d04dca406d6aa0\nparent c642090337a71df67b952e662aa5f3cf45d1cce2\nauthor Brandon Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1770922376 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770922376 -0500\n\nRHCLOUD-44853: Update pipeline to use v2 ConfigMaps and remove chrome sidecar (#737)\n\n* Update pipeline to use v2 ConfigMaps and remove chrome sidecar\n\nUpdate the pull request pipeline to align with the new shared konflux\npipeline definition that removes the insights-chrome-dev sidecar.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove chrome-port parameter (was 9912)\n- Rename test-app-port to e2e-app-port\n- Remove test-app-name parameter\n- Update frontend-proxy-routes-configmap to use -v2 suffix\n- Update pipeline reference to catastrophe-brandon/konflux-pipelines commit fda9a7ea\n- Remove taskRunSpecs section (sidecar configuration now handled by pipeline)\n\nThe new architecture routes all requests directly to the application\ncontainer, simplifying the pipeline execution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add hostAliases for stage.foo.redhat.com in E2E tests\n\nAdd hostAliases configuration to properly resolve stage.foo.redhat.com\nto localhost in the E2E test pod. This is the Kubernetes-native way to\nconfigure /etc/hosts entries.\n\nWithout this configuration, getent hosts stage.foo.redhat.com fails\nand the E2E tests cannot connect to the frontend-dev-proxy sidecar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n* Update .tekton/frontend-starter-app-pull-request.yaml\n\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjiGICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARu0QAKE4o6gYXC7w3iLy8IkP+X0y\nudhIz7OEQn+bqGDCBKn3n+iSqrkDoNlkL+ER+vTH+Ef9ljmP9aukNHC67cq0OKSk\nkLvTtD4MDMXLo8v/RSl8Kl8IWfwcVoIAoh39G7yxuU9qEeztXDPrpS/u+k0KkTQx\nMShLMokcuJgd+2Z3jL3vRLnJRKGCY15Z/kQCmc3C1K3X5UYIQvzZyOiMBKMFoyDb\nOPzjEaAfIQecYZQ8A5ZZMjQ7NxIR+tXCBxq8mIjQtq+VPU20W2IBJVDpCbdp9llj\nx9wKAyv4HeAfM+Yl8rJaLJCvebGH7S+Geoij4P/6lceGtjmK