WQzNTk1MGNjNWNjMmJlYzhlMmJkM2VmNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcontent/commit/2013a4692ea2f1b7dc4acc9d6d9ea25ffc01f551","sha":"2013a4692ea2f1b7dc4acc9d6d9ea25ffc01f551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/2013a4692ea2f1b7dc4acc9d6d9ea25ffc01f551"}],"sha":"73314c1648246bed35950cc5cc2bec8e2bd3ef6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/73314c1648246bed35950cc5cc2bec8e2bd3ef6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42536778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdusolle","id":42536778,"login":"sdusolle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM2Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdusolle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/2013a4692ea2f1b7dc4acc9d6d9ea25ffc01f551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:25:34Z","email":"42536778+sdusolle@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sonia Dusolle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:25:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: migrate testClientSideValidation to Cypress (#2767)\n\n* test(selectorTypes): cover the email constraint message and per-field error scoping\n\nMigrates the assertions of the Selenium test FieldsValidationTest.testClientSideValidation that Cypress did not already cover. Its invalid-date assertion already lives in pickers/date.cy.ts, so what lands here is the email field''s own constraint message and the fact that each validation error stays on the field that produced it.\n\nDateField.addNewValue gains force on its Date overload and passes it to clear() as well as type(). On a form long enough for the section header to turn sticky, the date input ends up position: fixed beneath that header, and no scroll can uncover it.\n\nRefs #2765\n\n* test(selectorTypes): share the blur helper and name the spec after what it asserts\n\nThe local blurField() becomes Field.blurTextField(), so every field page object gets it -- the date test reached for the same thing and had to click the input''s right edge instead.\n\nclientSideValidation named the Selenium test it came from; the spec asserts how a validation message behaves across two fields, so it is messageValidation now, and the site key follows.\n\nRefs #2765","tree":{"sha":"25fc1704192a9875480a3e52a0b512d088e82122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/25fc1704192a9875480a3e52a0b512d088e82122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/2013a4692ea2f1b7dc4acc9d6d9ea25ffc01f551","verification":{"payload":"tree 25fc1704192a9875480a3e52a0b512d088e82122\nparent 3be1999399de3e67e31308f11efe7edd9d406fd3\nauthor Sonia Dusolle <42536778+sdusolle@users.noreply.github.com> 1789046734 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789046734 +0200\n\ntest: migrate testClientSideValidation to Cypress (#2767)\n\n* test(selectorTypes): cover the email constraint message and per-field error scoping\n\nMigrates the assertions of the Selenium test FieldsValidationTest.testClientSideValidation that Cypress did not already cover. Its invalid-date assertion already lives in pickers/date.cy.ts, so what lands here is the email field''s own constraint message and the fact that each validation error stays on the field that produced it.\n\nDateField.addNewValue gains force on its Date overload and passes it to clear() as well as type(). On a form long enough for the section header to turn sticky, the date input ends up position: fixed beneath that header, and no scroll can uncover it.\n\nRefs #2765\n\n* test(selectorTypes): share the blur helper and name the spec after what it asserts\n\nThe local blurField() becomes Field.blurTextField(), so every field page object gets it -- the date test reached for the same thing and had to click the input''s right edge instead.\n\nclientSideValidation named the Selenium test it came from; the spec asserts how a validation message behaves across two fields, so it is messageValidation now, and the site key follows.\n\nRefs #2765","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoq/OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACC0QAG4gQkyo5mCipJyLOwH0bOXa\nAkcLiJ9lU1lXkcStaV/9xSexHKdaqDwdVzc9qPIZqomNiac351HWE1tZl7UGsJ3z\nPfv3emurX8AKo5dlEF1NhIcpt3tbTXKhRGQsqXw4GyTkJGHhLRYu1jJif19IvA5g\nJgXZgLj+wHMDVjccKMC6ePfskvCBvPexDJ5bQ5vgtNL66BYHEpsaK+0y6bAvkw6M\nHCEbYjoQkSiKgQG6zTL6ORhOFHXdH4mKF/BqsTM/xiGFefPTzA9PgMRZOQd1PGZW\nyjPNEwy8n7KeOZu7JnydP5w6P8zsIUo+mWKA70D+jXnUY7MCaWFQBi4y/T1tDYWB\nuzHjGMeo+KL+rx7JE+uQKEmm35aW0hmL+byJCBxTsHj6yl1IdIwT7CqxZEcYLteT\noY+xZxs2dZOpX6TBeBt4hhClMzJpRZ3UH4BvrhU/pMnOeIQC+a6ZiHXIfIbmqftn\nnNuPWnHD2P2M2pZqb+SFf9JYYsFUdxYJCAUnZNPV5V8hpJQ7q/IQpMZU8W0Miclx\nhnE7bIY/2wiQs7OjZrCY8J41lNjBoLTVO6ARciXTlR9B67fxUcCB3PTEub3HPMBn\n1e3R89toqkI4Jf4mY9Yp9I3QNOoZdg/FtagB3r/G9yCKoW2dT4OA/FCM52697WJc\nNhns5vh6oDWsnz/bLyrJ\n=r3HK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T13:25:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_