hub.com/users/AKarmanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/2acfdf971417530f2b84d54f54b7cca69cddfda9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:48:53Z","email":"alexandrk_@hotmail.com","name":"Alex Karmanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:48:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tests): resolve the module line the branch builds, and the test library it locks (#2686)\n\nThe nightly provisions jcontent from unversioned snapshot coordinates, so Maven\nresolves the highest snapshot in the repository rather than the line this branch\nbuilds. 3.8.0-SNAPSHOT is still published but abandoned (last built 2026-07-28),\nso every run installed that stale artifact and discarded the freshly built jar.\n\nPin the three jcontent-owned coordinates to the current line, and pin\n@jahia/cypress exactly: ci.build.sh/ci.startup.sh pass the package.json range\nstraight to `npx --package`, which bypasses yarn.lock and floats to the newest\nminor.","tree":{"sha":"d776f7ced99c7d1f6121940c857fe992ea10c88b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/d776f7ced99c7d1f6121940c857fe992ea10c88b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/2acfdf971417530f2b84d54f54b7cca69cddfda9","verification":{"payload":"tree d776f7ced99c7d1f6121940c857fe992ea10c88b\nparent 91b4eaec6acf5892a52500f32ffd215d659c3964\nauthor Alex Karmanov <alexandrk_@hotmail.com> 1786718933 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786718933 +0200\n\nfix(tests): resolve the module line the branch builds, and the test library it locks (#2686)\n\nThe nightly provisions jcontent from unversioned snapshot coordinates, so Maven\nresolves the highest snapshot in the repository rather than the line this branch\nbuilds. 3.8.0-SNAPSHOT is still published but abandoned (last built 2026-07-28),\nso every run installed that stale artifact and discarded the freshly built jar.\n\nPin the three jcontent-owned coordinates to the current line, and pin\n@jahia/cypress exactly: ci.build.sh/ci.startup.sh pass the package.json range\nstraight to `npx --package`, which bypasses yarn.lock and floats to the newest\nminor.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfyrVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGRYQAFfv6MSoWcy07VytbON5Leir\n9KgonrLMD9+Pqddesr/yLROzta6Et4tjnUi7yyRu0HaXZbtIQ2rtwdmLf4j82i1b\nn6i1NqPtLwhqRT7Lhjc99D4FVQNdkSbcwp4ZVt8psb34F2kR+b+xP1EP0tusoeOM\npRz0VMKJUI8uyqbhjZeL5eCq8pC7C6YnKNp2HGnxtcE6KacAVbFPsUQNf5pMWY+B\nvAgb7DK80EZY0uaKzbrgyHxJDVPyABIya1EkrIdYqlglqmqDj/3upQSju4pvcw3g\nf9kDE40d0ayRDBQBNQbX+pZo2oY74nv15JM/1LQ8Yh91ZzgTZVUtt7s3+vFpWXyL\nGp8eT38U88hh0Iucc+knSPHruixHY/Lju0QZhvE4TRLyPidhDaoa7TDT47xsZtZ9\nKswMZdPadYOwc4Zu3y7Okry2oO6lbqIRLuTiABCj0rytQ55w0FL85tBzgTK2q9e9\nBG70KmLky0My66L76jdIgZPfpKw3HLrrI1vY/SukvHbZ4kaWMBUEEs23OJyge8pj\n8gTzwhgxl80ixzj6mubBS/x4CLodELsBW36UIywyveYKb6dPK/O2zp0klAkHiwR4\nwArvvieh6AJ7SP6jP+Zj6QG92gn0u3K4cOUTEFK3ASO9+RD7PMNSQzioxxorqbUH\nimCi7vmGrkHy/0kCNZtd\n=Wczo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T14:49:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","