rl":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayblanc","id":121936,"login":"jayblanc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTkzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/c6a41061a723e5471c73c502ead7609588a84a26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:14:17Z","email":"jblanchard@jahia.com","name":"Jerome Blanchard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:14:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tests): make the runner-log task optional for consumers of jcontent-cypress (#2685)\n\nPageBuilderModule.hoverUntilBoxed reports its hover retry count through\ncy.task(''log''). That task is declared in this repo''s cypress.config.common.ts,\nwhich files: [\"dist\"] does not publish, so every consuming repo that bumps\n@jahia/jcontent-cypress and never declared the task fails on the call instead\nof losing a diagnostic line.\n\nRoute the diagnostic through a helper that uses the task when the consumer''s\nconfig announces it and falls back to cy.log otherwise. The announcement sits\nnext to the registration so the two cannot drift.","tree":{"sha":"2d8caeb59f9599adb40f58fb210dee75017815c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/2d8caeb59f9599adb40f58fb210dee75017815c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/c6a41061a723e5471c73c502ead7609588a84a26","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d8caeb59f9599adb40f58fb210dee75017815c5\nparent b523c9fa51cd75f4fecf936