ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayblanc","id":121936,"login":"jayblanc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTkzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayblanc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/c72389493e3bc08580d11e0551cc2707c2ee96ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:46:03Z","email":"jblanchard@jahia.com","name":"Jerome Blanchard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:46:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tests): re-fire the hover until the page-builder box exists (#2647)\n\n* fix(tests): re-fire the hover until the page-builder box exists\n\ngetHeader() fired a single realHover() and handed off to getBox(), whose\nquery then retried for the whole command timeout. Cypress retry-ability\nreplays the last query of a chain, never the actions preceding it — so a\nmouseover landing before the EditFrame overlay attached its listeners to a\nfreshly (re)loaded iframe was lost for good, and the retry could only burn\nthe timeout. Deterministic-looking within a run, oscillating across runs.\n\nAdd hoverUntilBoxed(), which re-fires the hover on every attempt until the\nbox for this module is present (optionally until it carries\ndata-box-hovered=\"true\"), bounded by a wall-clock budget, and fail with a\nmessage that names what did not happen instead of a generic query timeout.\n\nhover() is left as-is on purpose: hasNoHeaderAndFooter() asserts the absence\nof a box and must not wait for one.","tree":{"sha":"b7d595d3d00a7642c2e6e80ffa3b3e5e7dd9ff94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/b7d595d3d00a7642c2e6e80ffa3b3e5e7dd9ff94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/c72389493e3bc08580d11e0551cc2707c2ee96ec","verification":{"payload":"tree b7d595d3d00a7642c2e6e80ffa3b3e5e7dd9ff94\nparent a5a18f6ce01d77c1833b466708d47f3ae839ba60\nauthor Jerome Blanchard <jblanchard@jahia.com> 1786369563 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786369563 +0200\n\nfix(tests): re-fire the hover until the page-builder box exists (#2647)\n\n* fix(tests): re-fire the hover until the page-builder box exists\n\ngetHeader() fired a single realHover() and handed off to getBox(), whose\nquery then retried for the whole command timeout. Cypress retry-ability\nreplays the last query of a chain, never the actions preceding it — so a\nmouseover landing before the EditFrame overlay attached its listeners to a\nfreshly (re)loaded iframe was lost for good, and the retry could only burn\nthe timeout. Deterministic-looking within a run, oscillating across runs.\n\nAdd hoverUntilBoxed(), which re-fires the hover on every attempt until the\nbox for this module is present (optionally until it carries\ndata-box-hovered=\"true\"), bounded by a wall-clock budget, and fail with a\nmessage that names what did not happen instead of a generic query timeout.\n\nhover() is left as-is on purpose: hasNoHeaderAndFooter() asserts the absence\nof a box and must not wait for one.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqedYbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/usQABq8QF72YHfo4ViovYImV+5n\nj3cKdKyL9T3Mqs0fusqTBoW5iW+StXDPM/aZAiJ06OBNeWeo7nzNzHdDeYFcQ2/j\nkFeSYHFUEBrA4ik604tY1TzWONTWO8B6c+pyGtHQ08x05GCtZeKhejz8OsW8mTPH\n9gJifkwJltncf801ph4ZYS88U8YwZNbaW3ylcGYo/z20VVelZx3jjMj0Im0npECk\n+Hwf21ajXFkEbA9/zKxybvlj9Myb70FV7fJUZKkK4UOvH7mO+ifb8on1CdCPdvR3\nKqi8GBgqvOFFJnpuAtMXna2DTQuHNRnL5JapfByf8/X95QirQq9Glw+H9cUmyEzv\n1X68sIhOLIf4DeGCLDvFLRCNhUH+/HljdvZ8B6