ba60","node_id":"C_kwDOCBq_hdoAKGE1YTE4ZjZjZTAxZDc3YzE4MzNiNDY2NzA4ZDQ3ZjNhZTgzOWJhNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcontent/commit/1c7c9166b8a7bd907dfb0c603ba30017ebd9b1c6","sha":"1c7c9166b8a7bd907dfb0c603ba30017ebd9b1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/1c7c9166b8a7bd907dfb0c603ba30017ebd9b1c6"}],"sha":"a5a18f6ce01d77c1833b466708d47f3ae839ba60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/a5a18f6ce01d77c1833b466708d47f3ae839ba60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8562956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AKarmanov","id":8562956,"login":"AKarmanov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjI5NTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AKarmanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/1c7c9166b8a7bd907dfb0c603ba30017ebd9b1c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T14:55:52Z","email":"alexandrk_@hotmail.com","name":"Alex Karmanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T14:55:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Create content at the clicked insertion point position (#2635) (#2638)\n\nInsertion points anchor new content by reordering it before the child\nthey sit above, using `nodeName` from `getElemAttributes()`. Since\nc476df3a that function returns early with `{}` for insertion points, so\n`nodeName` was undefined and `reorderNodes` pushed `null` into\n`childrenOrder`, failing the `reorderChildren` mutation. The new node\nstayed where the JCR put it: at the end of the list.\n\nCompute `nodeName` before the early return, and skip pushing the anchor\nwhen it is missing. Fixes create, paste and pasteReference on insertion\npoints.\n\nAdds a Cypress regression test asserting the resulting child order.","tree":{"sha":"84626a2714f440d85b996ce74b472e087796756f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/84626a2714f440d85b996ce74b472e087796756f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/1c7c9166b8a7bd907dfb0c603ba30017ebd9b1c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 84626a2714f440d85b996ce74b472e087796756f\nparent 40793a8c4fb86b3925e45a8a5b264e9ca809bf0e\nauthor Alex Karmanov <alexandrk_@hotmail.com> 1786028152 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786028152 -0400\n\nfix: Create content at the clicked insertion point position (#2635) (#2638)\n\nInsertion points anchor new content by reordering it before the child\nthey sit above, using `nodeName` from `getElemAttributes()`. Since\nc476df3a that function returns early with `{}` for insertion points, so\n`nodeName` was undefined and `reorderNodes` pushed `null` into\n`childrenOrder`, failing the `reorderChildren` mutation. The new node\nstayed where the JCR put it: at the end of the list.\n\nCompute `nodeName` before the early return, and skip pushing the anchor\nwhen it is missing. Fixes create, paste and pasteReference on insertion\npoints.\n\nAdds a Cypress regression test asserting the resulting child order.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdKB4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARJ0QAIULEgOUm5ufQZs1KrHGIZb1\nxWGYJXVJ3CUdaZAI0UB4+6mHF9CTzGKtL4fdO5GKI1J+bAbr0MmHg87k9rUI+Sac\n7NEcGeo/kXdZP32mQlC8fKsjru9SRBuRCVZOGZyd2pYE1VkzQFZIx5hCBs0FACGu\n+fLrJ3mJ3CcJ5dE1