e\nserver-availability-manager''s schema-description test requires every node to be\ndocumented.\n\nAdd `@GraphQLDescription` to both arguments.\n\nRefs Jahia/server-availability-manager#251","tree":{"sha":"82f89780646d311d45bff74a686dd92106ebbecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/82f89780646d311d45bff74a686dd92106ebbecd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/63efa30bd9e1a25fc30b17977475f76fa71a3b53","verification":{"payload":"tree 82f89780646d311d45bff74a686dd92106ebbecd\nparent 04c9e9182b7d9e2e5df19d60c183b16aa4140d74\nauthor Erik Allais <eallais@jahia.com> 1784654145 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784654145 +0200\n\ndocs: describe findAvailableNodeName GraphQL arguments (#2592)\n\nThe `findAvailableNodeName` field on the JCRNode content-editor extension had a\ndescription, but its two arguments (`nodeType`, `language`) had none. They are\nreachable under `JahiaAdminQuery` via the Tag Manager backend, where\nserver-availability-manager''s schema-description test requires every node to be\ndocumented.\n\nAdd `@GraphQLDescription` to both arguments.\n\nRefs Jahia/server-availability-manager#251","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX6lBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA35sQAHGhH1S9z4fblSVcj3HioSFP\n/0ukgcz2QLhqivSlgbGazgd5Q/i6NFU9isVTjEwj0dFd/CAqMW5IPViLS0BncJL+\nvCZnK+OXWvO3v+Q/Px27+6Wdefx6WnikslH0RgwXDyS6IeyuKD2Mop4cllq19hGh\nVqcU9IVNBVTqcCc9T+A4m82Un5SN4UZ9oDJf4o5FiQ4sQ2WuSYfEY8+3mfas3UOm\n4VkjK6v6UzkBTtJprz7zxTbW7RTpAPT+tSmcKMXUmXNtbx1BRJwc7TFoauYPMBov\nIZDaWabWkiMi0Uj4OXr5ftjM4hy7Ug58pQUIkF4wRz3U4RKEWXTEqSWzbhd5QgwE\nCREbq07LO8wrA68cE3zyxF8EdGRQo5hZzlkISNgHdr1n6Xtsx8k7MEyOOZhQdJbU\nV3d9NAAyM0rXpoJSY+q8wvA2Wjyp3T6jtc/wCwm+o7vV7yoXnB7B6JRXN9zyeW8D\nPlwfJ0lbI5MBO1pJHJIlX1mg0SY9A7B6pslGm5Bc0MZ4WvXuBd51edw707AZ34P9\nh342Gsg3D6vtadH++QGfdn73CeKH66ZTgfvfX8ESPx7RMGk1dvK6FkjdC6vJe1GN\nPeFwBI2HRyaRDlQv5hBIw1AKq0k0r2bZ0IMNp9fRsLZ7fwG/YmltgKweyMZlbZXl\nFEJseHy9BekFZKMwoJiB\n=I5Nw\n