epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/delallioui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/delallioui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/delallioui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/delallioui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/commits/6eb09406a7ac70db1d6ca2677ba4327490189591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:06:00Z","email":"delallioui@jahia.com","name":"Driss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:06:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: support a badge/count on Content Editor header tabs (#2555) (#2577)\n\nHeader-tab actions (target `editHeaderTabsActions`) could only contribute a\nstatic i18n `buttonLabel` and an icon, so a module had no way to show a dynamic\nindicator on its tab — e.g. the content-versioning \"Version\" tab reading the\nnode''s version count.\n\nAdd an optional `buttonBadge` field on a tab action: a React element rendered\nafter the label as the moonstone Dropdown option''s trailing `iconEnd`. The\ncontributing module owns the badge and whatever data it needs to display it;\ntabs that omit `buttonBadge` render exactly as before.\n\nThe tab -> option mapping is extracted into a small pure `buildTabOption`\nhelper so the passthrough is unit-tested without mounting the whole header.\n\nCloses #2555","tree":{"sha":"c752833d8a7d01e981850afeefa8ab8b13346632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/c752833d8a7d01e981850afeefa8ab8b13346632"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/6eb09406a7ac70db1d6ca2677ba4327490189591","verification":{"payload":"tree c752833d8a7d01e981850afeefa8ab8b13346632\nparent f4fb03e8b3c5b0c479afb9341207341443fc1400\nauthor Driss <delallioui@jahia.com> 1784534760 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784534760 +0200\n\nfeat: support a badge/count on Content Editor header tabs (#2555) (#2577)\n\nHeader-tab actions (target `editHeaderTabsActions`) could only contribute a\nstatic i18n `buttonLabel` and an icon, so a module had no way to show a dynamic\nindicator on its tab — e.g. the content-versioning \"Version\" tab reading the\nnode''s version count.\n\nAdd an optional `buttonBadge` field on a tab action: a React element rendered\nafter the label as the moonstone Dropdown option''s trailing `iconEnd`. The\ncontributing module owns the badge and whatever data it needs to display it;\ntabs that omit `buttonBadge` render exactly as before.\n\nThe tab -> option mapping is extracted into a small pure `buildTabOption`\nhelper so the passthrough is unit-tested without mounting the whole header.\n\nCloses #2555","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXdboCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/GYQAEV/xH0HQHV/vMfRhElNnPtl\n/AZCLLVeDL2QwFiwjXdsz5X+0DbjbqN3/x/6f7+5WWpBjrS8GrGp8niJ/5nvjLeD\nFa2HC3TpnzxllREqXIoVpEt5UYfYWrut2BvQQ9LCDWe7G9ospreWYZL+IEKzpedt\npkJNQWeEjUguJcaCY1HbGE8xNbUqwUQ58QOe7sITG5OE/59AyNIr7AbpR0igfKPf\nN+fh5gmiEbjQ+fgQkvugoAPDV8bexaJTfXAwsjjluSj38aOZBl1illsCwxyFKhZE\nEv5ubN1YGBqvesCtFWtJ5ahRXr57UcPQGDUYO/h1sLL6hdV3vF+zGH4M+21Kst57\nnH+f8gRDprLdmJ8hmRMwvSXf8wvLK/d2YGERpdaW+SeFONGfjcaE/5UrYhP3GGl6\nCHweZ2+Ed307OQU2FFFVRBfpqq1fBPrhc0FiSinSmnXvjvBpvKpCj/OL2pU49KRd\nO4XOxAVci9AHW+9mUkOW6wcq+dN0By+SdSKohuv/kER4Yn3Sg+NwRKGajWxcCwgs\nXeQoCupvRIUI1Tt984NZOWKCm+mGLs1cFzICaLjXg9uaWUHSxY5CqAI9PPG2w+Uf\nSWbwCGkAgFbrkonV91OOUfRqcgJWeY72Z7Sl9uZzJOZ+1jqPTbqN1YZs4z2L65D1\n0fg/H1isJ2loRvQUp9rb\n=Wagy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T08:06:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/