e A-boJwxx.md\n\n* chore: use Number.parseInt over the global parseInt (#2437)\n\nSonarQube flags the global parseInt. Switch TextAreaField to\nNumber.parseInt and document the Number.* static-method convention in\nAGENTS.md.","tree":{"sha":"b8bc09b67448860e5970eb3a9cf19ffdf897d461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/b8bc09b67448860e5970eb3a9cf19ffdf897d461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/373acf66662fea9672886362bc50290d294fff98","verification":{"payload":"tree b8bc09b67448860e5970eb3a9cf19ffdf897d461\nparent 78def39b66e5c57ac3bab2b4b8779ead0e678580\nauthor Alex Karmanov <alexandrk_@hotmail.com> 1784219311 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784219311 -0400\n\nfix: apply textarea height from the field definition (#2437) (#2569)\n\n* fix: apply textarea height from the field definition (#2437)\n\nThe height selector option (textarea[height=''...'']) was ignored because\nTextAreaField hardcoded the textarea style, so every textarea rendered at\nthe same size. Read the height option and apply it as the textarea height\n(and max-height); when it is absent the textarea keeps its natural size.\n\nAdds the cent:textArea definition to the test module plus unit and Cypress\ncoverage.\n\n* Update A-boJwxx.md\n\n* chore: use Number.parseInt over the global parseInt (#2437)\n\nSonarQube flags the global parseInt. Switch TextAreaField to\nNumber.parseInt and document the Number.* static-method convention in\nAGENTS.md.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWQavCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAO14QAIXl6nfc6XEsHTd5KN9RJO6T\na2hRB4f1y562nuO9Ot1d1s0vznyaMLghXHIUTJKVqxeRkAYGnHOq0Ggbr6eW4h70\nVN+YfTN7V+ONuY5z8v9CS9WubC8NyXxxioiEqD1WF5Tk7S2REYCpeR0F+imvgphl\nUPgyFvvgu6qNNNmb1qb2kPPK2P+clFr5OcLQPgvRN6tTq2SDe4P7o8XISbbcWJA7\nf62DVrKATqPDyIf8aeuKY+c/N+RskTgwJ+Wb248AIFu3mQ2xZtGk4xTLhH0vwhjQ\nJrYQRi6g7xA8NzNo/rfzgR8x48rRVOTMd+vLWjgPUZV+XN8wwzzRfmC+qTPLVBi6\nWKYi8QitQzwdtw2e6h2TotZzbdxkM4enMyHhGiexG