mb:hover), which made the thumb\ndisappear in Chrome on the jContent accordion panels.\n\nScope a custom scrollbar to the accordion panels (and their scrollable\nchildren) via ContentNavigation''s SecondaryNav, keeping the same light-grey\nthumb colour on hover so it stays visible.\n\n* Create 1Okubbxl.md","tree":{"sha":"f89a85364a4c76d10c863c0aa5be24f6e9eb248a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/trees/f89a85364a4c76d10c863c0aa5be24f6e9eb248a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcontent/git/commits/ff6b8451a5b3c43e0b8c0b0b183722f6151ab333","verification":{"payload":"tree f89a85364a4c76d10c863c0aa5be24f6e9eb248a\nparent f93988981c1739b9f5f9ca8c9c18cbb79995b9b1\nauthor Alex Karmanov <alexandrk_@hotmail.com> 1784124856 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784124856 -0400\n\nfix: keep accordion panel scrollbar visible on hover (#1600) (#2563)\n\n* fix: keep accordion panel scrollbar visible on hover (#1600)\n\nThe Jahia UI shell applies a global custom scrollbar whose thumb switches\ncolour on hover (::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover), which made the thumb\ndisappear in Chrome on the jContent accordion panels.\n\nScope a custom scrollbar to the accordion panels (and their scrollable\nchildren) via ContentNavigation''s SecondaryNav, keeping the same light-grey\nthumb colour on hover so it stays visible.\n\n* Create 1Okubbxl.md","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV5W4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIVcQAHqLlRHzFCPOafEcXk19AldF\nsasvvjQd2mngKOJbJAkXjnSOXeT4+2G1MZna7MywdCH4esurs7Bxl7LQDdFJdtXx\nz7rbJ/UAIvECTwzRxcxnZMSS1BhCXUjtk/y1/I4BHDpiLD3u/KGIAcGkvwwvmc1Z\ns1ne9LlIfzy4EETD7JA9ihn0dHwGYonruhwGFLMJIBvawR/ZuzuSfkvLrotAVW9Z\nwRddHrjQeJWY2ojVowEG6kPFrCjWbBufsUPgdMXpuWTzdvK9f8DvYf0fpAnFsQbs\nx1rz83mz1/7HXNjh9yigm/1Wy6z+mPvw2hO28iWozhMZFHIHbPdYKpj4Gv5YaUz1\nQhpDYANYAooKynUtbQQJgIp8Y/+Q2T7wDk3ZXvMCjw3787naxvTELXkNj9mAPbhi\nTCIiyTPsi0JawKbR3BsiEyBhzMr2HbdbZTkD91L0GVt7bMyhvc6IRO2y1PkMSEoQ\nRlpFGvCGsZFzUWSJoHfzJUTNPa0io