/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/commits/f514452dfae5bd734689d8c1b688fbd1f7d638da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:11:18Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:11:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump plugin.spring from 2.4.10 to 2.4.20 (#765)\n\nBumps [plugin.spring](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin) from 2.4.10\nto 2.4.20.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases\">plugin.spring''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.20</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_SUPERCLASS in LinkedListTest.kt,\nkotlinx.coroutines</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85856\"><code>KT-85856</code></a>\ncontainingSymbol of constructor property differs for local and non-local\nclasses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-65417\"><code>KT-65417</code></a>\nK2 IDE: KTOR false positive expect-actual matching error on enum class\nbecause of implicit clone() in non-JVM source sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Code Compilation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-76457\"><code>KT-76457</code></a>\nK2 IDE / KMP Debugger: KISEWA “Cannot compile a common source without a\nJVM counterpart” on evaluating inline fun from common module inside\njvm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. FIR</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70552\"><code>KT-70552</code></a>\nNo expects for actual</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69727\"><code>KT-69727</code></a>\nK2 IDE. Wrong error in the editor on calling <code>clone</code> function\nof actual enum instance in non-jvm platform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69726\"><code>KT-69726</code></a>\nFP errors on declaring <code>fun clone()</code> in actual enum in\nnot-jvm source-set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86014\"><code>KT-86014</code></a>\nTypes are broken after remove parameter through change signature</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86363\"><code>KT-86363</code></a>\nKotlinIllegalArgumentExceptionWithAttachments: No dangling modifier\nfound on companion blocks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86147\"><code>KT-86147</code></a>\nDrop <code>kotlin.parallel.resolve.under.global.lock</code> registry\nkey</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85543\"><code>KT-85543</code></a>\nAvoid lazy resolve for the contracts phase if no constracts might be\nresolved</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Infrastructure</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84914\"><code>KT-84914</code></a>\nDo not publish analysis-api-test-framework</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86986\"><code>KT-86986</code></a>\n<code>kotlin-compiler-common-for-ide</code> bundles unrelated Analysis\nAPI modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86186\"><code>KT-86186</code></a>\nAnalysis API: Codebase tests run twice in some analysis modules — pick a\nsingle JUnit runner and migrate</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85360\"><code>KT-85360</code></a>\nDrop kotlin-compiler-testdata-for-ide artifact</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85585\"><code>KT-85585</code></a>\nSimplify the dependencies graph for the Analysis API modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85381\"><code>KT-85381</code></a>\nRemove tests for the FE10 implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Light Classes</h3>\n<h4>New Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84645\"><code>KT-84645</code></a>\nSupport resolving to companion block members &amp; extensions from Java\n(light classes)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-80775\"><code>KT-80775</code></a>\nSupport PsiClass#getRecordComponents in light classes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-57537\"><code>KT-57537</code></a>\nSLC: propagate default parameter value from (<code>@JvmOverloads</code>)\n<code>expect</code> declarations to <code>actual</code>\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85040\"><code>KT-85040</code></a>\n[Analysis API] Improve Java / Kotlin interop in KMP projects</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87301\"><code>KT-87301</code></a>\nSymbolLightAccessorMethod#isValid returns false for delegated\nproperties</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87171\"><code>KT-87171</code></a>\nSLC: non-mapped Kotlin collection supertype is dropped from supertype\nlist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87250\"><code>KT-87250</code></a>\nJvmExposeBoxed: light classes shouldn''t be autogenerated for private\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70428\"><code>KT-70428</code></a>\nAA: good code is red when a Java class extends a Kotlin class\nimplementing MutableList by delegation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-63568\"><code>KT-63568</code></a>\nSymbol Light Classes:\nKtAnnotationApplicationWithArgumentsInfo.normalizedArguments() may work\nincorrectly when psi is not set</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/ChangeLog.md\">plugin.spring''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.4.20</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_SUPERCLASS in LinkedListTest.kt,\nkotlinx.coroutines</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85856\"><code>KT-85856</code></a>\ncontainingSymbol of constructor property differs for local and non-local\nclasses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-65417\"><code>KT-65417</code></a>\nK2 IDE: KTOR false positive expect-actual matching error on enum class\nbecause of implicit clone() in non-JVM source sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Code Compilation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-76457\"><code>KT-76457</code></a>\nK2 IDE / KMP Debugger: KISEWA “Cannot compile a common source without a\nJVM counterpart” on evaluating inline fun from common module inside\njvm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. FIR</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70552\"><code>KT-70552</code></a>\nNo expects for actual</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69727\"><code>KT-69727</code></a>\nK2 IDE. Wrong error in the editor on calling <code>clone</code> function\nof actual enum instance in non-jvm platform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69726\"><code>KT-69726</code></a>\nFP errors on declaring <code>fun clone()</code> in actual enum in\nnot-jvm source-set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86014\"><code>KT-86014</code></a>\nTypes are broken after remove parameter through change signature</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86363\"><code>KT-86363</code></a>\nKotlinIllegalArgumentExceptionWithAttachments: No dangling modifier\nfound on companion blocks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86147\"><code>KT-86147</code></a>\nDrop <code>kotlin.parallel.resolve.under.global.lock</code> registry\nkey</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85543\"><code>KT-85543</code></a>\nAvoid lazy resolve for the contracts phase if no constracts might be\nresolved</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Infrastructure</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84914\"><code>KT-84914</code></a>\nDo not publish analysis-api-test-framework</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86986\"><code>KT-86986</code></a>\n<code>kotlin-compiler-common-for-ide</code> bundles unrelated Analysis\nAPI modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86186\"><code>KT-86186</code></a>\nAnalysis API: Codebase tests run twice in some analysis modules — pick a\nsingle JUnit runner and migrate</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85360\"><code>KT-85360</code></a>\nDrop kotlin-compiler-testdata-for-ide artifact</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85585\"><code>KT-85585</code></a>\nSimplify the dependencies graph for the Analysis API modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85381\"><code>KT-85381</code></a>\nRemove tests for the FE10 implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Light Classes</h3>\n<h4>New Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84645\"><code>KT-84645</code></a>\nSupport resolving to companion block members &amp; extensions from Java\n(light classes)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-80775\"><code>KT-80775</code></a>\nSupport PsiClass#getRecordComponents in light classes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-57537\"><code>KT-57537</code></a>\nSLC: propagate default parameter value from (<code>@JvmOverloads</code>)\n<code>expect</code> declarations to <code>actual</code>\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85040\"><code>KT-85040</code></a>\n[Analysis API] Improve Java / Kotlin interop in KMP projects</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87301\"><code>KT-87301</code></a>\nSymbolLightAccessorMethod#isValid returns false for delegated\nproperties</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87171\"><code>KT-87171</code></a>\nSLC: non-mapped Kotlin collection supertype is dropped from supertype\nlist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87250\"><code>KT-87250</code></a>\nJvmExposeBoxed: light classes shouldn''t be autogenerated for private\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70428\"><code>KT-70428</code></a>\nAA: good code is red when a Java class extends a Kotlin class\nimplementing MutableList by delegation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-63568\"><code>KT-63568</code></a>\nSymbol Light Classes:\nKtAnnotationApplicationWithArgumentsInfo.normalizedArguments() may work\nincorrectly when psi is not set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-36740\"><code>KT-36740</code></a>\nMPP: False-positive incompatible types in .java when using expect-class\nreturned by non-expect member from common when actual is actual\ntypealias</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/890ac1d94fdb80eb85f0eeb5be5e4352df987b2f\"><code>890ac1d</code></a>\nAdd Changelog for 2.4.20-RC3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/8860aed4ae4541301f24147d6785c764fa2bef89\"><code>8860aed</code></a>\n🍒 [FIR] Fix suspend conversion when expected type is nullable (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/issues/7769\">#7769</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/ab5bcd94281c167d5b55887b78bd04ee13abdf35\"><code>ab5bcd9</code></a>\nEdit ChangeLog for 2.4.20-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/9464edc097f4490b304f8a6d43ded010f6c8746e\"><code>9464edc</code></a>\nAdd ChangeLog for 2.4.20-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/0261e43b78e4db832fb347bb5a055eeba293d742\"><code>0261e43</code></a>\nCherry-pick &quot;Fix <code>asBodyAndResultVar</code> call in\n`visitInlinedLambdaInComposable...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/0763513670c55c40532e4ed84ac7c1e01bf6a772\"><code>0763513</code></a>\n[box-tests] Workaround for klib compatibility tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/issues/7626\">#7626</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/045aec6647e3f4e82d91d51d255c77d51f980c7c\"><code>045aec6</code></a>\n[Wasm] Append scripts from webpack.config.d in the end of the file (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/issues/7615\">#7615</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/cd7173bf0b61eb5a831d6425fbb7f05dea19b312\"><code>cd7173b</code></a>\n🍒 [2.4.20] [K/JS] Keep associated obj annotation only if getInstance\nsurvives...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/d36a2ffbccc4247c4d9fd18f62f369cca9b0054b\"><code>d36a2ff</code></a>\nCastsOptimizationPass: break aliases cycles (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/issues/7578\">#7578</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/8664983b34dca6193996f745d441f8edf6da0031\"><code>8664983</code></a>\n[CLI] Restore custom IC search scope creation</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/compare/v2.4.10...v2.4.20\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"16cfb76a389ddff18e62fa6108049c3070735112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/git/trees/16cfb76a389ddff18e62fa6108049c3070735112"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/git/commits/f514452dfae5bd734689d8c1b688fbd1f7d638da","verification":{"payload":"tree 16cfb76a389ddff18e62fa6108049c3070735112\nparent 643928e17510ed13dbfde3f78a8c14c6181abd64\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790867478 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790867478 +0000\n\nchore(deps): bump plugin.spring from 2.4.10 to 2.4.20 (#765)\n\nBumps [plugin.spring](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin) from 2.4.10\nto 2.4.20.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases\">plugin.spring''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.20</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_SUPERCLASS in LinkedListTest.kt,\nkotlinx.coroutines</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85856\"><code>KT-85856</code></a>\ncontainingSymbol of constructor property differs for local and non-local\nclasses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-65417\"><code>KT-65417</code></a>\nK2 IDE: KTOR false positive expect-actual matching error on enum class\nbecause of implicit clone() in non-JVM source sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Code Compilation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-76457\"><code>KT-76457</code></a>\nK2 IDE / KMP Debugger: KISEWA “Cannot compile a common source without a\nJVM counterpart” on evaluating inline fun from common module inside\njvm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. FIR</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70552\"><code>KT-70552</code></a>\nNo expects for actual</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69727\"><code>KT-69727</code></a>\nK2 IDE. Wrong error in the editor on calling <code>clone</code> function\nof actual enum instance in non-jvm platform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69726\"><code>KT-69726</code></a>\nFP errors on declaring <code>fun clone()</code> in actual enum in\nnot-jvm source-set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86014\"><code>KT-86014</code></a>\nTypes are broken after remove parameter through change signature</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86363\"><code>KT-86363</code></a>\nKotlinIllegalArgumentExceptionWithAttachments: No dangling modifier\nfound on companion blocks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86147\"><code>KT-86147</code></a>\nDrop <code>kotlin.parallel.resolve.under.global.lock</code> registry\nkey</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85543\"><code>KT-85543</code></a>\nAvoid lazy resolve for the contracts phase if no constracts might be\nresolved</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Infrastructure</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84914\"><code>KT-84914</code></a>\nDo not publish analysis-api-test-framework</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86986\"><code>KT-86986</code></a>\n<code>kotlin-compiler-common-for-ide</code> bundles unrelated Analysis\nAPI modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86186\"><code>KT-86186</code></a>\nAnalysis API: Codebase tests run twice in some analysis modules — pick a\nsingle JUnit runner and migrate</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85360\"><code>KT-85360</code></a>\nDrop kotlin-compiler-testdata-for-ide artifact</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85585\"><code>KT-85585</code></a>\nSimplify the dependencies graph for the Analysis API modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85381\"><code>KT-85381</code></a>\nRemove tests for the FE10 implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Light Classes</h3>\n<h4>New Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84645\"><code>KT-84645</code></a>\nSupport resolving to companion block members &amp; extensions from Java\n(light classes)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-80775\"><code>KT-80775</code></a>\nSupport PsiClass#getRecordComponents in light classes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-57537\"><code>KT-57537</code></a>\nSLC: propagate default parameter value from (<code>@JvmOverloads</code>)\n<code>expect</code> declarations to <code>actual</code>\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85040\"><code>KT-85040</code></a>\n[Analysis API] Improve Java / Kotlin interop in KMP projects</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87301\"><code>KT-87301</code></a>\nSymbolLightAccessorMethod#isValid returns false for delegated\nproperties</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87171\"><code>KT-87171</code></a>\nSLC: non-mapped Kotlin collection supertype is dropped from supertype\nlist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87250\"><code>KT-87250</code></a>\nJvmExposeBoxed: light classes shouldn''t be autogenerated for private\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70428\"><code>KT-70428</code></a>\nAA: good code is red when a Java class extends a Kotlin class\nimplementing MutableList by delegation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-63568\"><code>KT-63568</code></a>\nSymbol Light Classes:\nKtAnnotationApplicationWithArgumentsInfo.normalizedArguments() may work\nincorrectly when psi is not set</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/ChangeLog.md\">plugin.spring''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.4.20</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_