ies</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87171\"><code>KT-87171</code></a>\nSLC: non-mapped Kotlin collection supertype is dropped from supertype\nlist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87250\"><code>KT-87250</code></a>\nJvmExposeBoxed: light classes shouldn''t be autogenerated for private\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70428\"><code>KT-70428</code></a>\nAA: good code is red when a Java class extends a Kotlin class\nimplementing MutableList by delegation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-63568\"><code>KT-63568</code></a>\nSymbol Light Classes:\nKtAnnotationApplicationWithArgumentsInfo.normalizedArguments() may work\nincorrectly when psi is not set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-36740\"><code>KT-36740</code></a>\nMPP: False-positive incompatible types in .java when using expect-class\nreturned by non-expect member from common when actual is actual\ntypealias</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/890ac1d94fdb80eb85f0eeb5be5e4352df987b2f\"><code>890ac1d</code></a>\nAdd Changelog for 2.4.20-RC3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/8860aed4ae4541301f24147d6785c764fa2bef89\"><code>8860aed</code></a>\n🍒 [FIR] Fix suspend conversion when expected type is nullable (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/issues/7769\">#7769</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/ab5bcd94281c167d5b55887b78bd04ee13abdf35\"><code>ab5bcd9</code></a>\nEdit ChangeLog for 2.4.20-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/9464edc097f4490b304f8a6d43ded010f6c8746e\"><code>9464edc</code></a>\nAdd ChangeLog for 2.4.20-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/0261e43b78e4db832fb3