phon-ktsystems</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/paulk-asert\">Paul King</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/qiu-tiandev\">Qiu Tian</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sandeshgorde\">rg_sandesh</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/rpalcolea\">Roberto Perez Alcolea</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/seanxuu\">Sean</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Goooler\">Zongle Wang</a>.</p>\n<h2>Upgrade instructions</h2>\n<p>Switch your build to use Gradle 9.8.0 by updating your wrapper:</p>\n<pre><code>./gradlew :wrapper --gradle-version=9.8.0 &amp;&amp;\n./gradlew :wrapper\n</code></pre>\n<p>See the Gradle <a\nhref=\"https://docs.gradle.org/9.8.0/userguide/upgrading_version_9.html\">9.x\nupgrade guide</a> to learn about deprecations, breaking changes and\nother considerations when upgrading.</p>\n<p>For Java, Groovy, Kotlin and Android compatibility, see the <a\nhref=\"https://docs.gradle.org/9.8.0/userguide/compatibility.html\">full\ncompatibility notes</a>.</p>\n<h2>Reporting problems</h2>\n<p>If you find a problem with this release, please file a bug on <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/issues\">GitHub Issues</a>\nadhering to our issue guidelines.\nIf you''re not sure you''re encountering a bug, please use the <a\nhref=\"https://discuss.gradle.org/c/help-discuss\">forum</a>.</p>\n<p>We hope you will build happiness with Gradle, and we look forward to\nyour feedback via <a href=\"https://twitter.com/gradle\">Twitter</a> or on\n<a href=\"https://github.com/gradle\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2>9.8.0 RC3</h2>\n<p>The Gradle team is excited to announce Gradle 9.8.0 RC3.</p>\n<p>Here are the highlights of this release:</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/a927be5e08efe79e0b87ada06c762dde6bb9f8b8\"><code>a927be5</code></a>\nAdd the Develocity plugin back to the Android smoke tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39273\">#39273</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/eaee500e6a2fff583b9d2b81039fc15ad887462d\"><code>eaee500</code></a>\nAdd the Develocity plugin back to the Android smoke tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/189b672308d1e997fae46412673d04683d76b35a\"><code>189b672</code></a>\nRoute everything still hitting Maven Central through the mirror (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39257\">#39257</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/36b181477307fc6db0e16582f11daaeb7e34fc8e\"><code>36b1814</code></a>\nAdd back mavenCentral to doc snippets</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/2740c2d9cd0a9ab42813be77241fdc264217b2ba\"><code>2740c2d</code></a>\nUpdate Gradle wrapper to version 9.8.0-rc-3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39264\">#39264</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/209938316e373c847aa1a251ec14eeded3da468e\"><code>2099383</code></a>\nUpdate Gradle wrapper to version 9.8.0-rc-3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/c80202fbd1cc457d7f45f31fc488391c4a2e7984\"><code>c80202f</code></a>\nRoute everything still hitting Maven Central through the mirror</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/3f6a53434a2cf4f33486af2ae5eabd1fc830352d\"><code>3f6a534</code></a>\nFix when a best practice was introduced (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39253\">#39253</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/9efc9eddac43f0795194e407c0ab2177a1d23cf9\"><code>9efc9ed</code></a>\nFix when a best practice was introduced</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/459e1433c60e4a604dd39ffe2c49e3606f70acda\"><code>459e143</code></a>\nRoute integration test dependencies through the repository mirror (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39239\">#39239</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional com