":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:38:28Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:38:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump kotestVersion from 6.2.4 to 6.2.5 (#770)\n\nBumps `kotestVersion` from 6.2.4 to 6.2.5.\nUpdates `io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5` from 6.2.4 to 6.2.5\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/releases\">io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v6.2.5</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>skill version update PR upon release by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6213\">kotest/kotest#6213</a></li>\n<li>use a singleton strategy for getConfigurationFactory of Kotest\nlegacy producers + ensure the same config is reused for gradle producers\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6216\">kotest/kotest#6216</a></li>\n<li>Use <code>withEdtSafeAnalysis</code> to improve safe analysis for\nspec and style… by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6215\">kotest/kotest#6215</a></li>\n<li>Make the <code>shouldBeSingleton</code> block overloads infix by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6223\">kotest/kotest#6223</a></li>\n<li>Bound the short/byte/uShort/uByte shrinkers by the generator range\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6224\">kotest/kotest#6224</a></li>\n<li>Alex/make default extension registry thread safe by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6199\">kotest/kotest#6199</a></li>\n<li>add back jsoup assertions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6226\">kotest/kotest#6226</a></li>\n<li>Fix Android StackWalker compatibility by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cfcromn\"><code>@​cfcromn</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6222\">kotest/kotest#6222</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.4...v6.2.5\">https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.4...v6.2.5</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/41df99d60c7093cfe4f48638fe2bf4b2d7f8b1c5\"><code>41df99d</code></a>\nFix Android StackWalker compatibility (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6222\">#6222</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/8655ca73f2682055af0db3b81cbede05d10f050f\"><code>8655ca7</code></a>\nadd back jsoup assertions (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6226\">#6226</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/e2271eb187aec4ce4a581fea777825c68a9d60f1\"><code>e2271eb</code></a>\nAlex/make default extension registry thread safe (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6199\">#6199</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/fdca60984121899038daac2f7b5537ce46b8630c\"><code>fdca609</code></a>\nBound the short/byte/uShort/uByte shrinkers by the generator range (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6224\">#6224</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/56301a629b268e6960d6a9cda05a3024badb8d7a\"><code>56301a6</code></a>\nMake the <code>shouldBeSingleton</code> block overloads infix (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6223\">#6223</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/dfee83ac086872c0ffe788d975e39d66f074f141\"><code>dfee83a</code></a>\nUse <code>withEdtSafeAnalysis</code> to improve safe analysis for spec\nand style… (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6215\">#6215</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/c44d1c3caa43135533a2da886506681811927c8c\"><code>c44d1c3</code></a>\nuse a singleton strategy for getConfigurationFactory of Kotest legacy\nproduce...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/b74611b017dccca1fed08f22ba04145e47d3ba2b\"><code>b74611b</code></a>\nskill version update PR upon release (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6213\">#6213</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/0d3c09a3629cd7fe77873cc26f3abdf39856beef\"><code>0d3c09a</code></a>\n6.2.4 claude marketplace manual update</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.4...6.2.5\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.kotest:kotest-extensions-spring` from 6.2.4 to 6.2.5\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/releases\">io.kotest:kotest-extensions-spring''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v6.2.5</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>skill version update PR upon release by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6213\">kotest/kotest#6213</a></li>\n<li>use a singleton strategy for getConfigurationFactory of Kotest\nlegacy producers + ensure the same config is reused for gradle producers\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.