tps://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/commits/3d84a825c57c4b6b4098e5deccb0d4a9deb5fb00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T09:55:38Z","email":"80095835+AudunSorheim@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AudunSorheim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T09:55:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fjern gammelt agentoppsett og slank repoinstruksjoner (#759)\n\nFjerner kopierte agenter og skills, synkemanifest og alle workflows for\nagentoppsett. Erstatter generelle maler og rammeverkseksempler med 16\nlinjer i `.github/copilot-instructions.md` og én pekerlinje i\n`AGENTS.md`. Overflødige path-instrukser fjernes.\n\nBeholder testprofil, persontilgang, historiske skjemasvar og repoets\nmigreringsnummerering.\n\nDen påkrevde oppsettssjekken er fjernet fra grenreglene. Appens bygg-,\ntest- og deployflyter er beholdt.\n\nKontrollert endringsomfang, lokale filpekere, uendrede app-workflows og\nfravær av gamle oppsettsreferanser. Ingen appbygg er kjørt for denne\ninstruksjonsendringen.","tree":{"sha":"06c0708d650adfd41ebaae61b8e782961cd60d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/git/trees/06c0708d650adfd41ebaae61b8e782961cd60d9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/git/commits/3d84a825c57c4b6b4098e5deccb0d4a9deb5fb00","verification":{"payload":"tree 06c0708d650adfd41ebaae61b8e782961cd60d9d\nparent 90d44e91a4d87ff1ac38c213e6f68de9881612f5\nauthor AudunSorheim <80095835+AudunSorheim@users.noreply.github.com> 1788947738 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788947738 +0000\n\nFjern gammelt agentoppsett og slank repoinstruksjoner (#759)\n\nFjerner kopierte agenter og skills, synkemanifest og alle workflows for\nagentoppsett. Erstatter generelle maler og rammeverkseksempler med 16\nlinjer i `.github/copilot-instructions.md` og én pekerlinje i\n`AGENTS.md`. Overflødige path-instrukser fjernes.\n\nBeholder testprofil, persontilgang, historiske skjemasvar og repoets\nmigreringsnummerering.\n\nDen påkrevde oppsettssjekken er fjernet fra grenreglene. Appens bygg-,\ntest- og deployflyter er beholdt.\n\nKontrollert endringsomfang, lokale filpekere, uendrede app-workflows og\nfravær av gamle oppsettsreferanser. Ingen appbygg er kjørt for denne\ninstruksjonsendringen.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoS0rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy/4QAG5N93Bons5D11kOCMfumeak\nT7U6Npew67ioxfW6f55/ccezT0gZW4GaTZoex3qeP8jUOZNmZc+MfL2j3Va8Ckiy\nGUh5h9MX7Z6gJjg+0xq5KSVtQukR+hXGQs5JMBW/P5tp2/Ja5noQky7NjoSistpn\nPhPcEBxPc2jR3RQ58nXhyT2KnaOulFP5fhIfYFXcfhNJ8LIMcWzOZTMPQ0Jvv5FV\nIpmMTh7qdfFF8n3COqusiW8LRXiOEGQgNi2PXEnAh+6ynrFqt9YwpfkDXZqhOqBr\nLTD2z5gUnXN4KYQNPL3I92cw8HCAiv8ex3DuRjznCGRQ9n1B+Va7RrCWgGUwyGBy\nAGkZxOMQp45qxacko2EtrQdoJRwuUVgGuXX440PDIJNaKIOB24pJDu4oqo9iUbdE\nhNt2GAf8+PGKdLy7MVx/ysLh7Na6rXer2moZGCrGo/TG57GlbmWMjLZv+5tvyzqX\nJwaublWHj2Fg85TEr/qtcti3x4/fRm/lc5shMbZ1II5zw0bgXblYKDzjQ/JPy6gD\nN934VAcjsFm1zJI+dLZwPXW9w4YvmBXHb2e3mDA5T5Oj7e/inuZfULd2dnYERjpG\nyP+qxDE0OR8m0r27Zx+4m0hpDu37DxCGTqonaWeXQNRbI5D8FUQXLuki2rtaqGa1\nMI69quSMP1PnpLkfWFAr\n=s2Yr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T09:55:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs"