apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/commits/bf58044aa997eb623657c61bf793f6f59dd385a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:30:26Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:30:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump plugin.spring from 2.3.21 to 2.4.10 (#734)\n\nBumps [plugin.spring](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin) from 2.3.21\nto 2.4.10.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases\">plugin.spring''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.10</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86939\"><code>KT-86939</code></a>\nJVM: IllegalStateException &quot;No value for annotation parameter&quot;\nwhen using const val in nested Java annotation array argument</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83766\"><code>KT-83766</code></a>\nK2: Wrong sourcePsi is set for <code>SymbolPsiLiteral</code> in SLC for\nannotation arguments referencing a const val</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86728\"><code>KT-86728</code></a>\nReified type inference: expected type not propagated into inline call\ninside lambda with elvis operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compose Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/522127447\"><code>b/522127447</code></a>\nCompose Compiler 2.4: classes previously inferred <code>stable</code>\nnow reported <code>runtime</code>/<code>Uncertain</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Klibs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86501\"><code>KT-86501</code></a>\nNative: IrTypeAliasSymbolImpl is already bound. Signature:\nkotlinx.datetime/Instant|null[0] on iosSimulatorArm64</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. CLI</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86930\"><code>KT-86930</code></a>\nIntroduce <code>kotlinr</code> in the Kotlin distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. BCV</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87223\"><code>KT-87223</code></a>\nGradle, BCV: open version range in kotlinAbiValidationCompatClasspath\ncauses kotlin-build-tools-impl to resolve to 2.4.20-Beta1 instead of\n2.4.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. JS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87304\"><code>KT-87304</code></a>\njsBrowserTest fails with &quot;exited with errors (exit code:\n1)&quot;</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86057\"><code>KT-86057</code></a>\nkotlinUpgradeYarnLock skips lock file regeneration when kotlinNpmInstall\nis up-to-date, causing kotlinStoreYarnLock to fail</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. Multiplatform</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87084\"><code>KT-87084</code></a>\nFalse positive warning for JS and Wasm compilations when CRI is\nenabled</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Scripts</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87076\"><code>KT-87076</code></a>\n<code>@file</code>:CompilerOptions(&quot;-jvm-target&quot;, ...) ignored\nin .main.kts scripts in Kotlin 2.4.0, falling back to JVM target\n1.8</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86352\"><code>KT-86352</code></a>\nK2 scripting: FirResolvedTypeRef exception when resolving extension\nfunctions from imported scripts</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.10-RC2</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/ChangeLog.md\">plugin.spring''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.4.10</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86939\"><code>KT-86939</code></a>\nJVM: IllegalStateException &quot;No value for annotation parameter&quot;\nwhen using const val in nested Java annotation array argument</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83766\"><code>KT-83766</code></a>\nK2: Wrong sourcePsi is set for <code>SymbolPsiLiteral</code> in SLC for\nannotation arguments referencing a const val</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86728\"><code>KT-86728</code></a>\nReified type inference: expected type not propagated into inline call\ninside lambda with elvis operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compose Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://issuetrac