li>fix(assertions): state the containExactCopies lower bound as at\nleast 1 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mvanhorn\"><code>@​mvanhorn</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6193\">kotest/kotest#6193</a></li>\n<li>General improvements - framework by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6190\">kotest/kotest#6190</a></li>\n<li>General improvements - IJ plugin by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6191\">kotest/kotest#6191</a></li>\n<li>fix jump to source by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6195\">kotest/kotest#6195</a></li>\n<li>Update dependency net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy to v1.18.11 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/renovate\"><code>@​renovate</code></a>[bot] in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6202\">kotest/kotest#6202</a></li>\n<li>Update dependency io.github.classgraph:classgraph to v4.8.186 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/renovate\"><code>@​renovate</code></a>[bot] in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6201\">kotest/kotest#6201</a></li>\n<li>update docs to clarify that <code>copies</code> in\nshouldContainExactCopies must be 1 or higher by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6207\">kotest/kotest#6207</a></li>\n<li>spring extension improvements by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6204\">kotest/kotest#6204</a></li>\n<li>sourceRef improvements by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin