ode>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6175\">kotest/kotest#6175</a></li>\n<li>add offsetDateTime.shouldHaveSameInstantAsZonedDateTime(other:\nZonedDateTime) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6173\">kotest/kotest#6173</a></li>\n<li>match fields of data classes that are data objects by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6177\">kotest/kotest#6177</a></li>\n<li>complete custom styles DSL by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6179\">kotest/kotest#6179</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/cfcromn\"><code>@​cfcromn</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6166\">kotest/kotest#6166</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.2...v6.2.3\">https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.2...v6.2.3</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/66dba712ea5f6e386727b99f8af770c88fdcd345\"><code>66dba71</code></a>\ncomplete custom styles DSL (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6179\">#6179</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/bff05c539523dbcdd6615016a43d0dcea7af9cac\"><code>bff05c5</code></a>\nmatch fields of data classes that are data objects (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6177\">#6177</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/b77203cd0826c19613491386b55777bab770b48d\"><code>b77203c</code></a>\nadd offsetDateTime.shouldHaveSameInstantAsZonedDateTime(other:\nZonedDateTime)...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/5814b418ed44f49965b6819b11b6182a042a3ab7\"><code>5814b41</code></a>\nadd Double.atMost (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6175\">#6175</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/9487ab20fabbe63b95fa7cb9036b90a898fa27ea\"><code>9487ab2</code></a>\nDocument Kotest Gradle plugin usage (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6166\">#6166</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/6.2.2...6.2.3\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.kotest:kotest-extensions-spring` from 6.2.2 to 6.2.3\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/releases\">io.kotest:kotest-extensions-spring''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v6.2.3</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Document Kotest Gradle plugin usage by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cfcromn\"><code>@​cfcromn</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6166\">kotest/kotest#6166</a></li>\n<li>add Double.atMost by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6175\">kotest/kotest#6175</a></li>\n<li>add offsetDateTime.shouldHaveSameInstantAsZonedDateTime(other:\nZonedDateTime) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6173\">kotest/kotest#6173</a></li>\n<li>match fields of data classes that are data objects by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6177\">kotest/kotest#6177</a></li>\n<li>complete custom styles DSL by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotes