/api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/syfomotebehov/commits/90443e73b7f9896c0a24c07b69db6eff8f9b9fe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:38:35Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:38:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump kotestVersion from 6.1.11 to 6.2.0 (#717)\n\nBumps `kotestVersion` from 6.1.11 to 6.2.0.\nUpdates `io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5` from 6.1.11 to 6.2.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/releases\">io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v6.2.0</h2>\n<h3>✨ Features</h3>\n<p><strong>New matchers / assertions</strong></p>\n<p>comparables.shouldBeAtLeast — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5831\">#5831</a>)\nMultipleMatcherResult for combining multiple matcher results — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5723\">#5723</a>)\nshouldContainExactCopies for lists — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5913\">#5913</a>)\nCharacter matchers — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JordanLongstaff\"><code>@​JordanLongstaff</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5921\">#5921</a>)\nshouldBeSingle matcher — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6028\">#6028</a>)\nshouldContainRepeats for strings — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6004\">#6004</a>)\nInfix form for inspectors — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5920\">#5920</a>)\nBlock-asserting overload for shouldBeFailure — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5927\">#5927</a>)\nPer-call Eq overrides via a withEqs DSL — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/PreAgile\"><code>@​PreAgile</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6010\">#6010</a>)\nPer-element data class diffs in collection comparisons — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/PreAgile\"><code>@​PreAgile</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5835\">#5835</a>)</p>\n<p><strong>Framework / API</strong></p>\n<p>Run data tests singularly — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5574\">#5574</a>)\nNew JVM test-suites 