ref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5937\">#5937</a>)\nArb.map half-open nextInt for targetSize — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5946\">#5946</a>)\nArb.factor crash on k=1 / never producing k — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5959\">#5959</a>)\nArb.date never producing Dec 31 in leap years — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5949\">#5949</a>)\nArb.intRange overflow when domain.last == Int.MAX_VALUE — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5945\">#5945</a>)\nArb.subsequence only producing prefixes — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5958\">#5958</a>)</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/f3134ea99f5543bea79adf9b743b6b1035afef49\"><code>f3134ea</code></a>\nalign compile toolchain with minimum supported Kotlin version for KLIB\nABI co...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/24a4dc4420d09856029e02cf6516d0a9d38f2188\"><code>24a4dc4</code></a>\nMake fibonacci interval functions public (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6135\">#6135</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/commit/28d5cdfcef5b834c2be623d0fc8cd90ce82e265f\"><code>28d5cdf</code></a>\nallow building all targets via dispatch of kotest-test-examples (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6136\">#6136</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref