nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5921\">#5921</a>)\nshouldBeSingle matcher — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6028\">#6028</a>)\nshouldContainRepeats for strings — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6004\">#6004</a>)\nInfix form for inspectors — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5920\">#5920</a>)\nBlock-asserting overload for shouldBeFailure — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5927\">#5927</a>)\nPer-call Eq overrides via a withEqs DSL — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/PreAgile\"><code>@​PreAgile</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6010\">#6010</a>)\nPer-element data class diffs in collection comparisons — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/PreAgile\"><code>@​PreAgile</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5835\">#5835</a>)</p>\n<p><strong>Framework / API</strong></p>\n<p>Run data tests singularly — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5574\">#5574</a>)\nNew JVM test-suites module (deprecates JunitXmlReporter) — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5801\">#5801</a>)\nSupport isolation modes on all KMP platforms — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5806\">#5806</a>)\nBreadcrumbs support for Kotest spec files — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5793\">#5793</a>)\nType-safe test metadata API — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/PreAgile\"><code>@​PreAgile</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5905\">#5905</a>)\nPublic API for creating custom styles — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5814\">#5814</a>)\nSupport multiple --test args joined by semicolon in\nKOTEST_INCLUDE_PATTERN — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5922\">#5922</a>)\nExtend life of deprecated Test containers and add onStart — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5896\">#5896</a>)\nMake Arb.stringPattern multiplatform — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/wilmveel\"><code>@​wilmveel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6008\">#6008</a>)\nComplete the permutations module — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6016\">#6016</a>)\nAdd Wasm WASI target to kotest-property and kotest-property-permutations\n— <a href=\"https://github.com/jsoizo\"><code>@​jsoizo</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6129\">#6129</a>)\nMake fibonacci interval functions public — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mvanhorn\"><code>@​mvanhorn</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/6135\">#6135</a>)\nAdd Android instrumented test module — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5900\">#5900</a>)</p>\n<p><strong>IntelliJ plugin</strong></p>\n<p>N-times setter for test invocation — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5815\">#5815</a>)\nInvocation count on the Kotest producer — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5837\">#5837</a>)\nSingular data-test run on the Kotest producer — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alfonsoristorato\"><code>@​alfonsoristorato</code></a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5843\">#5843</a>)\nAmper-aware run-configuration producer — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5999\">#5999</a>)</p>\n<h3>🐛 Fixes</h3>\n<p><strong>Property testing / Arb / Exhaustive / shrinkers</strong></p>\n<p>Integer shrinkers proposing wrap-around values near MIN — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5931\">#5931</a>)\nArb.ipAddressV4 couldn''t produce 255 in any octet — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5938\">#5938</a>)\nArb.multiple couldn''t produce the largest multiple of k ≤ max — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5939\">#5939</a>)\nArb.map maxSize off-by-one and minSize == maxSize crash — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5937\">#5937</a>)\nArb.map half-open nextInt for targetSize — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/issues/5946\">#5946</a>)\nArb.factor crash on k=1 / never producing k — <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotes