o 4.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/releases\">org.springframework.boot''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.1.0</h2>\n<p>Full <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/wiki/Spring-Boot-4.1-Release-Notes\">release\nnotes for Spring Boot 4.1</a> are available on the wiki.</p>\n<h2>:star: New Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add public constructor to InvalidConfigurationPropertyValueException\nthat accepts a cause <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50211\">#50211</a></li>\n<li>Reduce memory consumption when repeatedly calling\nWritableJson.toByteArray <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/49428\">#49428</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>:lady_beetle: Bug Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MailSender auto-configuration does not enable hostname verification\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50747\">#50747</a></li>\n<li>Artemis auto-configuration uses a predictable default location for\nthe embedded broker''s data <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50745\">#50745</a></li>\n<li>Embedded LDAP SSL should not be enabled when its bundle is empty <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/pull/50700\">#50700</a></li>\n<li>InetAddressFilter.externalAddresses does not exclude special purpose\naddresses from RFC 6890 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50668\">#50668</a></li>\n<li>NullPointerException in reactor-netty SniProvider and unmapped SSL\nbundle with RSocket <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50645\">#50645</a></li>\n<li>SSL should not be enabled when a SSL bundle is overridden to an\nempty string <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50635\">#50635</a></li>\n<li>Test auto-configuration no longer integrates Spring Security with\nHtmlUnitDriver <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50633\">#50633</a></li>\n<li>Configuration property metadata includes incorrect class references\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50632\">#50632</a></li>\n<li>Docker Compose support does not restore thread interrupt flag when\ncatching InterruptedException <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50618\">#50618</a></li>\n<li>RabbitProperties enables SSL even when spring.rabbitmq.ssl.bundle is\noverridden to an empty string <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50612\">#50612</a></li>\n<li>NullPointerException in reactor-netty SniProvider when SSL bundle\nuses client-auth or server truststore without server-name-bundles <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50610\">#50610</a></li>\n<li>SpringJtaPlatform should have been deprecated since 4.1.0-M3 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50592\">#50592</a></li>\n<li>Layer written outside the output location of ''//'' exception is\nthrown when using extract layers in root directory <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50510\">#50510</a></li>\n<li>ConfigurationPropertiesReportEndpoint exposes AOP proxy internals <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50417\">#50417</a></li>\n<li>Created StackTracePrinter instances have no access to the\nEnvironment <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50414\">#50414</a></li>\n<li>MappingsEndpoint reports the context''s own ID as parentId when a\nparent exists <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50412\">#50412</a></li>\n<li>Buildpack module does not validate long-to-int casts <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50410\">#50410</a></li>\n<li>Gradle gRPC support fails if protobuf-java dependency is used\ninstead of protobuf-java-util <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/pull/50405\">#50405</a></li>\n<li>GraphQL WebSocket support does not configure allowed origins <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50394\">#50394</a></li>\n<li>Spring Boot Loader Does Not Support RSA and EC Signed Jars <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50298\">#50298</a></li>\n<li>Meter registries are not removed from the global registry when the\ncontext is closed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50287\">#50287</a></li>\n<li>DataSourceBuilder cannot derive a DataSource from a lazy connection\nproxy <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/pull/50271\">#50271</a></li>\n<li>Nullable annotations from AbstractErrorController.getErrorAttributes\nare not aligned with implementation <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50266\">#50266</a></li>\n<li>Bean definitions can be added with an initializer before\nsetAllowBeanDefinitionOverriding is called <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50264\">#50264</a></li>\n<li>EndpointRequest links matcher unnecessarily matches HTTP methods\nother than GET <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50261\">#50261</a></li>\n<li>Actuator''s ''/cloudfoundryapplication'' endpoint does not work if\nrestrictive CORS configuration is provided using a bean named\ncorsConfigurationSource <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50258\">#50258</a></li>\n<li>ThreadPoolTaskScheduleBuilder unnecessarily loses precision when\nconfiguring await termination time <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/issues/50234\">#50234</a></li>\n<li>NimbusJwtDecoder silentl