to\n1.14.11.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mockk/mockk/releases\">io.mockk:mockk''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v1.14.11</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: added SameInstanceMatcher to handle an issue with equals method\nwhen using EqMatcher along with a mock to an object by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/DOssaA\"><code>@​DOssaA</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1508\">mockk/mockk#1508</a></li>\n<li>Add scoped confirmVerified overloads for callables (KFunction and\nKProperty) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/DOssaA\"><code>@​DOssaA</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1513\">mockk/mockk#1513</a></li>\n<li>feat: support MockKAnnotation.useDependencyOrder for JUnit 5 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ilia1243\"><code>@​ilia1243</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1515\">mockk/mockk#1515</a></li>\n<li>Allow updating settings from code by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Yentis\"><code>@​Yentis</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1517\">mockk/mockk#1517</a></li>\n<li>Add currentThread filter and excluded mocks to\nclearAllStubsFromMemory by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/evgenru\"><code>@​evgenru</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1519\">mockk/mockk#1519</a></li>\n<li>Support new Kotlin annotation defaulting rule for <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/InjectMockKs\"><code>@​InjectMockKs</code></a>\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/ZzAve\"><code>@​ZzAve</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1525\">mockk/mockk#1525</a></li>\n<li>feat(dsl): Add context parameters support module (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/issues/1431\">#1431</a>) by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/faraz152\"><code>@​faraz152</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1521\">mockk/mockk#1521</a></li>\n<li>fix: resolve <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/InjectMockKs\"><code>@​InjectMockKs</code></a>\ndependency order for interface by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/neungs-2\"><code>@​neungs-2</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1526\">mockk/mockk#1526</a></li>\n<li>fix: resolve <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/InjectMockKs\"><code>@​InjectMockKs</code></a>\ndependency order for list injection by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ilia1243\"><code>@​ilia1243</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1527\">mockk/mockk#1527</a></li>\n<li>fix: extract native lib from APK when not on filesystem (AGP 8.5+)\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/snowykte0426\"><code>@​snowykte0426</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1529\">mockk/mockk#1529</a></li>\n<li>fix: support OpenJ9 in JvmAutoHinter by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/hspedro\"><code>@​hspedro</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1530\">mockk/mockk#1530</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DOssaA\"><code>@​DOssaA</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1508\">mockk/mockk#1508</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ilia1243\"><code>@​ilia1243</code></a>\nmade their first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1515\">mockk/mockk#1515</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Yentis\"><code>@​Yentis</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1517\">mockk/mockk#1517</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/evgenru\"><code>@​evgenru</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/mockk/mockk/pull/1519\">mockk/mockk#1519</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ZzAve\"><code>@​ZzAve</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirec