kandidatVarselStatusDaoTest` — 10 DAO-integrasjonstester\n- `DialogmotekandidatVarselSchedulerTest` — 8\nscheduler-integrasjonstester (send, retry, backoff, max-retry, leader,\ncleanup)\n- `DialogmotekandidatKafkaIntegrationTest` — listener idempotens +\ndeserializer edge cases (gyldig/ugyldig JSON, manglende felter)\n- Eksisterende `DialogmotekandidatServiceTest` oppdatert\n\n### DTO-kompatibilitet\n\nVerifisert mot producer (`isdialogmotekandidat`):\n- 5 kjernefelt matcher eksakt (uuid, createdAt, personIdentNumber,\nkandidat, arsak)\n- 3 ekstra nullable-felt i producer ignoreres trygt\n(`FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES=false`)\n- `arsak` modellert som `String` — fremtidssikret mot nye enum-verdier\n\n### Referanser\n\nSe `docs/dialogmotekandidat-varsel-flow.md` for full flytbeskrivelse.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Audun Sørheim <audun.sorheim@nav.no>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/Z92CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgAoQAKyMbQ7xUFrK36JIgg1+0rGc\nyVHEJfqD1Qqyzui7Acg2B8C8mTkDeOv/EETNqHmqOuzpzGeXMP5vKtf+p1yPvu+j\nt0Dlt9Jh0p157i6K1l17W6x++I/Gd/hrMDo19tbACzc2v/5fCIii2dAk1GZyLsx5\ndO09Av4QFAx+PAfrrDtn97iMZXbhmmaR7ZXT9SwyfDz1H4tqpTawDdDIdoZ41amk\nQfKm7YjGtPHRdJHaKn14TsODG/ov3Xn2eQ/CeSGvPI22XdpOMPjaDIXHUzyRK1Ml\nV1bmLx+LkNkIL9Q9fDCsxSxl8gs9aZv0JC3ii34O1ejoX7X4rFxGrotTp/tygggw\nXdXQn0RKxdrp97pKkNXxqguid6Xm0atI92KyGpRdVSLUhdquqFhp5vWf/5vY84fc\nd7QCgscxeYXSq4+h8Nv8mfvWKQ5I9dXgm9i/9pjdE098yVpjhmKuJHvXVlKpvnqe\nbZNhs92V3n4SrZfUmtUzYV2vHcnsg4/Zxmkf1HBwJbOiIJPSvwmeHcR1i9X403TN\n2Hr0tje/qfNRjlGYtDRB8NQxi+wSIMY/iI9stC+0Q2EL+XC8n++rrOdOcElq9anz\nHoIstk337llTMaTkUd6oZh9S95v2RRdtXKRzZhjGtUxxi+0kfgFC2CGBgRotij9P\nkTligy6Hrp1dN6Ed7H1K\n=d492\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T08:31:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","follower