itter":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:48:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add Playwright export coverage for critical IQE cases (#2872)\n\n* test: add Playwright export coverage for critical IQE cases\n\nPort CSV/JSON export across CVEs, Systems, and detail pages plus CVEs PDF, asserting Vulnerability report API responses.\n\n* chore: remove comments\n\n* style: fix prettier in Playwright export helpers\n\n* test: simplify export toast asserts and harden CVEs navigation after export\n\nAssert Preparing then Downloading toasts like a thin IQE-style flow, allow\nlonger CVE-list export waits, and retry CVEs page load after stage crash.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* style: fix prettier in navHelpers\n\n* chore: remove comments\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e36166bcbf9c4ebcb4a7cd51035fd55fad4de7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/vulnerability-ui/git/trees/e36166bcbf9c4ebcb4a7cd51035fd55fad4de7c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/vulnerability-ui/git/commits/a8af1bd894df2633f33a85c787fd76ef77fd67f0","verification":{"payload":"tree e36166bcbf9c4ebcb4a7cd51035fd55fad4de7c2\nparent 0f340fb3c0d917954dc536b627a7c7318ba21db9\nauthor Niyaz Ansari <nansari@redhat.com> 1790164096 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790164096 +0530\n\ntest: add Playwright export coverage for critical IQE cases (#2872)\n\n* test: add Playwright export coverage for critical IQE cases\n\nPort CSV/JSON export across CVEs, Systems, and detail pages plus CVEs PDF, asserting Vulnerability report API responses.\n\n* chore: remove comments\n\n* style: fix prettier in Playwright export helpers\n\n* test: simplify export toast asserts and harden CVEs navigation after export\n\nAssert Preparing then Downloading toasts like a thin IQE-style flow, allow\nlonger CVE-list export waits, and retry CVEs page load after stage crash.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursorage